(5194399, 756596, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - I think it is a Water Lily.. but I <i>could</i> be wrong..  Nice capture with the bees, although a little dark/contrasty, in my opinion.  The black background seems unnatural with the bees (ie: not a studio shot, but again.. I could be wrong (apologies in advance if so)).</td>', '3 - I think it is a Water Lily.. but I could be wrong..  Nice capture with the bees, although a little dark/contrasty, in my opinion.  The black background seems unnatural with the bees (ie: not a studio shot, but again.. I could be wrong (apologies in advance if so)).', '2009-01-16 05:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
