(5194584, 756637, 63398, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! What a hoot! The very first entry up on my screen and it reminds me of my own! LOL!!! OF COURSE I think it''s terrific!<br/> <br/>Seriously, very well seen, shot, and edited. Great title for a lovely image. 9</td>', 'Wow!!! What a hoot! The very first entry up on my screen and it reminds me of my own! LOL!!! OF COURSE I think it''s terrific! Seriously, very well seen, shot, and edited. Great title for a lovely image. 9', '2009-01-16 07:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194591, 756554, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the slightly downtoned effect of whatever you did in PP. Very nice vista! 7</td>', 'I like the slightly downtoned effect of whatever you did in PP. Very nice vista! 7', '2009-01-16 07:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
