(5194626, 755207, 67152, '<td valign="top">the filled frame of faces is engaging but I wish the girl in the front with the big smile were the subject most in focus</td>', 'the filled frame of faces is engaging but I wish the girl in the front with the big smile were the subject most in focus', '2009-01-16 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194628, 756702, 67152, '<td valign="top">the impact of glass reflections and the imperfections that result in odd shapes creates a wonderful study - i just wish it were a bit higher contrast (more whites as opposed to more gray)</td>', 'the impact of glass reflections and the imperfections that result in odd shapes creates a wonderful study - i just wish it were a bit higher contrast (more whites as opposed to more gray)', '2009-01-16 08:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194633, 756427, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely scene - the sky burning, the lines of the shore reaching up to the bridge - but the image seems to lack just a bit of sharpness</td>', 'lovely scene - the sky burning, the lines of the shore reaching up to the bridge - but the image seems to lack just a bit of sharpness', '2009-01-16 08:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194635, 756607, 63398, '<td valign="top">Spectacular DOF!!! Tack sharp, great colour....VERY well done! Vivid &amp; Delightful. I can''t believe I''m giving a bunny an 8! LOL!!!</td>', 'Spectacular DOF!!! Tack sharp, great colour....VERY well done! Vivid & Delightful. I can''t believe I''m giving a bunny an 8! LOL!!!', '2009-01-16 08:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194640, 755614, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice intense pose and good sharpness of focus - the crop seems a bit tight at the top - having a bit more space up there might provide it a bit less ''closed'' feel</td>', 'nice intense pose and good sharpness of focus - the crop seems a bit tight at the top - having a bit more space up there might provide it a bit less ''closed'' feel', '2009-01-16 08:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194644, 755133, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely intensity of the face - beautiful child - lovely nostalgic processing to give it a timeless feel</td>', 'lovely intensity of the face - beautiful child - lovely nostalgic processing to give it a timeless feel', '2009-01-16 08:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194646, 754506, 63398, '<td valign="top">Awwww! Terminally cute! The B&amp;W was brave, IMO, yet it flies. The slightly hot areas of her shirt and left foot are what made this a 7 for me and not an 8.</td>', 'Awwww! Terminally cute! The B&W was brave, IMO, yet it flies. The slightly hot areas of her shirt and left foot are what made this a 7 for me and not an 8.', '2009-01-16 08:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194649, 754850, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the leading lines of the shore and how you were able to give the lake and the ground a dire feel - i just am not convinced of the sky - it seems too overprocessed for my tastes</td>', 'i like the leading lines of the shore and how you were able to give the lake and the ground a dire feel - i just am not convinced of the sky - it seems too overprocessed for my tastes', '2009-01-16 08:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194650, 756700, 63398, '<td valign="top">Interesting.....well shot, great DOF, good light and colors....WTF is a velvet staghorn?????? 6</td>', 'Interesting.....well shot, great DOF, good light and colors....WTF is a velvet staghorn?????? 6', '2009-01-16 08:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194654, 756615, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent details in the insect - it may have been natural super shallow DOF but it almost appears that some of the image was unnaturally blurred giving edges an odd look</td>', 'excellent details in the insect - it may have been natural super shallow DOF but it almost appears that some of the image was unnaturally blurred giving edges an odd look', '2009-01-16 08:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194660, 755794, 67152, '<td valign="top">very nice panning shot - the background being dark really helps accentuate the car</td>', 'very nice panning shot - the background being dark really helps accentuate the car', '2009-01-16 08:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194664, 756474, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely vision to see the possibilities of this - the repeating pose makes it and gives me a bit of a chuckle</td>', 'lovely vision to see the possibilities of this - the repeating pose makes it and gives me a bit of a chuckle', '2009-01-16 08:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194666, 754535, 39184, '<td valign="top">I love these canal boats!  I lived in England when I was a teen a would often ride my bike 80 miles roundtrip to Stratford Upon Avon and I have since daydreamed of this lifestyle of living on or vacationing on one these canal boats.  I have since lived on a sailboat for a couple of years.  Oh yeah, the photo!  You have done well with the composition/cropping of this shot considering how difficult it must have been working with such a long subject.  I would have liked for this shot to be taken while the boat was in a narrow canal.  That would have more completly told the story and I''m not sure that most voters will figure out the reason for the odd shape of the boat.  The lighting was not the best with the sun directly overhead and therefore the colors would probably have been a little more vibrant with the sun at a lower angle.  Regardless, you have managed to capture the essence of the lifestlye of this "couple''s" home well enough to bring back vivid memories for me.  Thanks.  7</td>', 'I love these canal boats!  I lived in England when I was a teen a would often ride my bike 80 miles roundtrip to Stratford Upon Avon and I have since daydreamed of this lifestyle of living on or vacationing on one these canal boats.  I have since lived on a sailboat for a couple of years.  Oh yeah, the photo!  You have done well with the composition/cropping of this shot considering how difficult it must have been working with such a long subject.  I would have liked for this shot to be taken while the boat was in a narrow canal.  That would have more completly told the story and I''m not sure that most voters will figure out the reason for the odd shape of the boat.  The lighting was not the best with the sun directly overhead and therefore the colors would probably have been a little more vibrant with the sun at a lower angle.  Regardless, you have managed to capture the essence of the lifestlye of this "couple''s" home well enough to bring back vivid memories for me.  Thanks.  7', '2009-01-16 08:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194667, 756747, 63398, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. Serene.....7</td>', 'Great portrait. Serene.....7', '2009-01-16 08:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194670, 756526, 67152, '<td valign="top">an interesting effort - the complex interactions of the real and reflections make it appear to be a mural - a bold entry for the Best of</td>', 'an interesting effort - the complex interactions of the real and reflections make it appear to be a mural - a bold entry for the Best of', '2009-01-16 08:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194676, 755492, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely light on the buildings - it almost has a feeling of a painting<br/> <br/>there does appear to be an issue with the sky though - i can see an unusual pink cloud in the left section of the sky and some almost green effects in other clouds</td>', 'lovely light on the buildings - it almost has a feeling of a painting there does appear to be an issue with the sky though - i can see an unusual pink cloud in the left section of the sky and some almost green effects in other clouds', '2009-01-16 08:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194679, 754443, 39184, '<td valign="top">Did you see my footprints where you were standing?  Overall, a nice capture of Horseshoe Bend.  I hope the voters don''t think that the greenish/yellowish tones around the water and on the left is a color cast.  This isn''t the easiest shot to post process but you have, in fact, done a good job of capturing this wonderous scene.</td>', 'Did you see my footprints where you were standing?  Overall, a nice capture of Horseshoe Bend.  I hope the voters don''t think that the greenish/yellowish tones around the water and on the left is a color cast.  This isn''t the easiest shot to post process but you have, in fact, done a good job of capturing this wonderous scene.', '2009-01-16 08:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194682, 755719, 67152, '<td valign="top">a great face - the partial desaturation really highlights the character</td>', 'a great face - the partial desaturation really highlights the character', '2009-01-16 08:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194688, 755496, 67152, '<td valign="top">almost two images in one - the girl seems almost overwhelmed by the winter wonderland - and that works nicely here.  I just wish we could see this at larger than 720 px as it is hard to really see her expression (maybe a tighter crop for the DPC posting would have been in order)</td>', 'almost two images in one - the girl seems almost overwhelmed by the winter wonderland - and that works nicely here.  I just wish we could see this at larger than 720 px as it is hard to really see her expression (maybe a tighter crop for the DPC posting would have been in order)', '2009-01-16 08:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194693, 754432, 67152, '<td valign="top">that is a serious face - i think i will comment quickly before it bites....<br/> <br/>really nice full face effort - the details in the nose are outstanding but i almost wish for a bit more DOF to really allow the eyes to be completely in focus</td>', 'that is a serious face - i think i will comment quickly before it bites.... really nice full face effort - the details in the nose are outstanding but i almost wish for a bit more DOF to really allow the eyes to be completely in focus', '2009-01-16 08:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194694, 754345, 39184, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo with one exception...the bright red on the left side.  After a short while I realized that this is how the light fell on the car and it wasn''t a background light, but I still think that if the lighting couldn''t have been adjusted to eliminate the bright spot then I would have cloned it out.  Otherwise, a really great shot and good use of selective desat.</td>', 'I really like this photo with one exception...the bright red on the left side.  After a short while I realized that this is how the light fell on the car and it wasn''t a background light, but I still think that if the lighting couldn''t have been adjusted to eliminate the bright spot then I would have cloned it out.  Otherwise, a really great shot and good use of selective desat.', '2009-01-16 08:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194697, 754605, 63398, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!! Terrific meld of detail &amp; motion!!! VERY nicely done!!! 9</td>', 'WOW!!!! Terrific meld of detail & motion!!! VERY nicely done!!! 9', '2009-01-16 08:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194702, 755681, 67152, '<td valign="top">the intensity of colors is outstanding here - i bet this looks great at full resolution<br/> <br/>to bad that person is in the scene to generate a slightly unbalanced feel - but you can fix that before you print out that large print!</td>', 'the intensity of colors is outstanding here - i bet this looks great at full resolution to bad that person is in the scene to generate a slightly unbalanced feel - but you can fix that before you print out that large print!', '2009-01-16 08:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194712, 754365, 39184, '<td valign="top">Outstanding job at panning to keep the car in focus.  I have a difficult time achieving such sharpness while panning with my subject.  Perfect colors too that are not overdone with the saturation.  I would have liked to see a little more in front of the car, however.  A landscape orientation with a little more leading space would have improved this shot to above a 7.</td>', 'Outstanding job at panning to keep the car in focus.  I have a difficult time achieving such sharpness while panning with my subject.  Perfect colors too that are not overdone with the saturation.  I would have liked to see a little more in front of the car, however.  A landscape orientation with a little more leading space would have improved this shot to above a 7.', '2009-01-16 08:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194715, 755482, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely colors and light here - soft and delicate</td>', 'lovely colors and light here - soft and delicate', '2009-01-16 08:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194722, 755620, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the choice of diagonal composition.  i am not usually a fan of this type of processing (the sky seems overdone and has an unusual halo) but i think it actually works here pretty well</td>', 'i like the choice of diagonal composition.  i am not usually a fan of this type of processing (the sky seems overdone and has an unusual halo) but i think it actually works here pretty well', '2009-01-16 08:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
