(5194732, 756678, 63398, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''S Macro!!! Talk about In-Your-Face! LOL!!! Nice! 8</td>', 'Now THAT''S Macro!!! Talk about In-Your-Face! LOL!!! Nice! 8', '2009-01-16 08:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194737, 756336, 20748, '<td valign="top">damn.</td>', 'damn.', '2009-01-16 08:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194738, 755975, 39184, '<td valign="top">Great variations of color and layers in the mountain ranges.  I think that this photo could have been greatly improved by focusing on the foreground more.  I believe that the general rule in a situation like this is to focus one third of the way into the photo which would probably be the second ridge back (the red one with the shadows).  This would have probably kept the foreground ridge in enough focus and if anything were to be out of focus it would be the background ranges and that would have been a little better for this shot.</td>', 'Great variations of color and layers in the mountain ranges.  I think that this photo could have been greatly improved by focusing on the foreground more.  I believe that the general rule in a situation like this is to focus one third of the way into the photo which would probably be the second ridge back (the red one with the shadows).  This would have probably kept the foreground ridge in enough focus and if anything were to be out of focus it would be the background ranges and that would have been a little better for this shot.', '2009-01-16 08:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194739, 756278, 63398, '<td valign="top">Terrific urban vignette......moody and forlorn....8</td>', 'Terrific urban vignette......moody and forlorn....8', '2009-01-16 08:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194741, 756334, 67152, '<td valign="top">majestic bird and pose - the lighting and focus are the main issue i see with the shot - the eye is in shadows and feathers and beak could use a bit more detail to really shine</td>', 'majestic bird and pose - the lighting and focus are the main issue i see with the shot - the eye is in shadows and feathers and beak could use a bit more detail to really shine', '2009-01-16 08:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194742, 755879, 63398, '<td valign="top">Almost a perfect capture. Whatever''s in the left lower foregrouind hurts this image some......still an awesome image, though.....7</td>', 'Almost a perfect capture. Whatever''s in the left lower foregrouind hurts this image some......still an awesome image, though.....7', '2009-01-16 08:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194761, 755524, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like this.....that said, for my tastes it''s pretty harsh contrast &amp; saturation. Still, a good image and worthy of a 7, IMO.</td>', 'I like this.....that said, for my tastes it''s pretty harsh contrast & saturation. Still, a good image and worthy of a 7, IMO.', '2009-01-16 08:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194765, 755545, 63398, '<td valign="top">This made me go "Oh, WOW!!" when it popped up.....''nuff said! 9 &amp; a Fave...</td>', 'This made me go "Oh, WOW!!" when it popped up.....''nuff said! 9 & a Fave...', '2009-01-16 08:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194770, 755508, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the focus on the eye and the contrast of the bright bird to the dark green background but the composition seems odd - with a large section of the bird''s body missing yet a lot of background above and on the sides - almost as if wasted space.  i think a tighter crop more specifically on the face and head would solve the issue</td>', 'i like the focus on the eye and the contrast of the bright bird to the dark green background but the composition seems odd - with a large section of the bird''s body missing yet a lot of background above and on the sides - almost as if wasted space.  i think a tighter crop more specifically on the face and head would solve the issue', '2009-01-16 08:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194777, 756526, 68956, '<td valign="top">Well observed - I can''t quite tell if I''m looking at Elvis through a window with reflections, or at an actual reflection of Elvis. Either way it''s held my attention a lot longer than some of the more conventional shots on here - well done ;)</td>', 'Well observed - I can''t quite tell if I''m looking at Elvis through a window with reflections, or at an actual reflection of Elvis. Either way it''s held my attention a lot longer than some of the more conventional shots on here - well done ;)', '2009-01-16 08:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194780, 756322, 67152, '<td valign="top">lots of interesting objects to study - the sky is beautiful with the patchwork of clouds, the mountains are majestic, and the railing is so ornate - but the choice of b/w processing here actually gives the left side of the image an almost nondescript look - little to no distinction between the mountain and railing on the left hand side of the image is visible - a higher contrast approach, some dodge/burn to separate the objects, the use of color instead of b/w - all choices i think might be worth exploring here</td>', 'lots of interesting objects to study - the sky is beautiful with the patchwork of clouds, the mountains are majestic, and the railing is so ornate - but the choice of b/w processing here actually gives the left side of the image an almost nondescript look - little to no distinction between the mountain and railing on the left hand side of the image is visible - a higher contrast approach, some dodge/burn to separate the objects, the use of color instead of b/w - all choices i think might be worth exploring here', '2009-01-16 08:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194782, 755368, 68956, '<td valign="top">A wonderful memory photograph for you, therefore a priceless image :)</td>', 'A wonderful memory photograph for you, therefore a priceless image :)', '2009-01-16 08:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194786, 756515, 68956, '<td valign="top">Yay! I wonder what he''s so pleased about, you''ve really caught a special, happy moment there - well done :)</td>', 'Yay! I wonder what he''s so pleased about, you''ve really caught a special, happy moment there - well done :)', '2009-01-16 09:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194790, 756647, 68956, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the post processing, but I love the way you''ve caught a natural, unposed moment :)</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the post processing, but I love the way you''ve caught a natural, unposed moment :)', '2009-01-16 09:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194793, 756713, 32736, '<td valign="top">Too many conflicting lines.</td>', 'Too many conflicting lines.', '2009-01-16 09:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194799, 754523, 68956, '<td valign="top">They really can fight can''t they :O You''ve caught a great piece of action there and the composition is spot on. Have you had to enlarge quite a severe crop or did you use a digital zoom? A lot of the detail has been lost, or more likely wasn''t there. Maybe set your camera up on a tripod with a remote cord allowing you to be a bit nearer to the action - you''ve got some great subjects there :)</td>', 'They really can fight can''t they :O You''ve caught a great piece of action there and the composition is spot on. Have you had to enlarge quite a severe crop or did you use a digital zoom? A lot of the detail has been lost, or more likely wasn''t there. Maybe set your camera up on a tripod with a remote cord allowing you to be a bit nearer to the action - you''ve got some great subjects there :)', '2009-01-16 09:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194804, 756757, 92296, '<td valign="top">I think I''d prefer this if it were cropped in tight around the schoolgirls and you could see more of their reflections.</td>', 'I think I''d prefer this if it were cropped in tight around the schoolgirls and you could see more of their reflections.', '2009-01-16 09:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194814, 756758, 32736, '<td valign="top">The angle doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'The angle doesn''t do it for me.', '2009-01-16 09:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194815, 754850, 39184, '<td valign="top">Nice, moody shot.  But it appears that it is tilted to left a lot.</td>', 'Nice, moody shot.  But it appears that it is tilted to left a lot.', '2009-01-16 09:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194818, 756539, 32736, '<td valign="top">This would be really cool if it were sharp.</td>', 'This would be really cool if it were sharp.', '2009-01-16 09:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194819, 755132, 63398, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.....love the contrast of eclectic subjects. LOVE the wood post! Terrific DOF. 8</td>', 'Interesting abstract.....love the contrast of eclectic subjects. LOVE the wood post! Terrific DOF. 8', '2009-01-16 09:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194827, 755567, 30791, '<td valign="top">hahahaha fuckers</td>', 'hahahaha fuckers', '2009-01-16 09:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194828, 754347, 39184, '<td valign="top">So much is great about this photo...the lighting and good control of highlights, the duotone processing, sharp focus in the right spot balanced with a nice touch of softness, the reflection, the vignette, and the layout of the dress to create the diagonal line in the composition.  But something as simple as a tilted horizon almost ruins the final product.</td>', 'So much is great about this photo...the lighting and good control of highlights, the duotone processing, sharp focus in the right spot balanced with a nice touch of softness, the reflection, the vignette, and the layout of the dress to create the diagonal line in the composition.  But something as simple as a tilted horizon almost ruins the final product.', '2009-01-16 09:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194829, 756192, 68956, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - the sort of thing I love to take and you''ve captured some wonderful colours. The only things that are unsettling me are the level of distraction the white water creates, and it''s central position. To me the real quality part of this picture is on the right hand side, especially the upper half, I''ve tried doing a simple crop with my hands on the screen and it really transforms it. However that''s totally subjective, it''s your image and I bet you love it just as it is, and rightly so :)</td>', 'Beautiful image - the sort of thing I love to take and you''ve captured some wonderful colours. The only things that are unsettling me are the level of distraction the white water creates, and it''s central position. To me the real quality part of this picture is on the right hand side, especially the upper half, I''ve tried doing a simple crop with my hands on the screen and it really transforms it. However that''s totally subjective, it''s your image and I bet you love it just as it is, and rightly so :)', '2009-01-16 09:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194831, 756292, 63398, '<td valign="top">Whoa!!!!! Splendid capture!! Extra points for rarity! 9</td>', 'Whoa!!!!! Splendid capture!! Extra points for rarity! 9', '2009-01-16 09:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
