(5194847, 756341, 84363, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be off.  It really appears that she is standing in front of some type of screen or print.  The black line going all the way down the right side is a giveaway.</td>', 'Focus seems to be off.  It really appears that she is standing in front of some type of screen or print.  The black line going all the way down the right side is a giveaway.', '2009-01-16 09:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
