(5194873, 755812, 15711, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of a Victorian paper cut out, but with a modern subject. I love silhouettes but wonder if this will get lost in WOW sunsets and super focused macros.  It is good and I hope people will judge each image on its own merit.  Man, you can even see the dog''s tongue. 7</td>', 'Makes me think of a Victorian paper cut out, but with a modern subject. I love silhouettes but wonder if this will get lost in WOW sunsets and super focused macros.  It is good and I hope people will judge each image on its own merit.  Man, you can even see the dog''s tongue. 7', '2009-01-16 09:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194874, 756763, 32736, '<td valign="top">Where was this taken?  I may have a shot of the same lighthouse.</td>', 'Where was this taken?  I may have a shot of the same lighthouse.', '2009-01-16 09:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194876, 756493, 67152, '<td valign="top">at least ten stories in one - the almost silhouette, the high key treatment, the separation of the various subjects - it exemplifies summer at the beach in a single shot</td>', 'at least ten stories in one - the almost silhouette, the high key treatment, the separation of the various subjects - it exemplifies summer at the beach in a single shot', '2009-01-16 09:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194877, 754712, 15711, '<td valign="top">Her hair!!! Was she jumping?  Her "huh, what was that" expression suits the wild background. I like the one sided lighting, so that she has the shadow on the right side of her face, yet is still illuminated. That cleft in her chin adds a nice bit of character to her face. Well done.</td>', 'Her hair!!! Was she jumping?  Her "huh, what was that" expression suits the wild background. I like the one sided lighting, so that she has the shadow on the right side of her face, yet is still illuminated. That cleft in her chin adds a nice bit of character to her face. Well done.', '2009-01-16 09:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194878, 755570, 84363, '<td valign="top">I live in Utah County and love to visit the southern part of the state!  Bryce is absolutley amazing!  I like the picture.  I''m not sure what I would change but it needs a little something to punch it up a bit.  Maybe if you had some sky with some clouds?  Or maybe a black border that was a little thicker?</td>', 'I live in Utah County and love to visit the southern part of the state!  Bryce is absolutley amazing!  I like the picture.  I''m not sure what I would change but it needs a little something to punch it up a bit.  Maybe if you had some sky with some clouds?  Or maybe a black border that was a little thicker?', '2009-01-16 09:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194883, 754359, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful exposure. I love how the ebbing tide is pulling our eye back into the photo.  Terrific tones. Love the frame too.</td>', 'Beautiful exposure. I love how the ebbing tide is pulling our eye back into the photo.  Terrific tones. Love the frame too.', '2009-01-16 09:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194884, 756440, 84363, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Image seems to be over-sharpened and/or pixelated.</td>', 'Good photo.  Image seems to be over-sharpened and/or pixelated.', '2009-01-16 09:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194885, 755667, 67152, '<td valign="top">good eye to see the possibilities of these forlorn trees on the beach looking out on a dramatic sky - overall it appears a bit dark and the number of trees  in the scene give it a slightly cluttered feel - i wonder if isolating one of the trees would have worked a bit better</td>', 'good eye to see the possibilities of these forlorn trees on the beach looking out on a dramatic sky - overall it appears a bit dark and the number of trees  in the scene give it a slightly cluttered feel - i wonder if isolating one of the trees would have worked a bit better', '2009-01-16 09:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194888, 754839, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL.  This is hilarious, a nice tribute to William Wegman''s Weimeraners. I think it could do with some tweaking in the editing department (maybe some level adjustments) but it is adorable.</td>', 'ROFL.  This is hilarious, a nice tribute to William Wegman''s Weimeraners. I think it could do with some tweaking in the editing department (maybe some level adjustments) but it is adorable.', '2009-01-16 09:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
