(5194891, 754744, 15711, '<td valign="top">A touch over exposed.  I wish the baby''s feet and hands were also in focus. Sweet, and I''m sure it means the world to the parents.</td>', 'A touch over exposed.  I wish the baby''s feet and hands were also in focus. Sweet, and I''m sure it means the world to the parents.', '2009-01-16 09:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
