(5194896, 754578, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - this is fabulous.  Almost has a painterly feel.  I love the greens and those pops of gold and red.  He''s almost a cartoon.  Nicely done.</td>', 'WOW - this is fabulous.  Almost has a painterly feel.  I love the greens and those pops of gold and red.  He''s almost a cartoon.  Nicely done.', '2009-01-16 09:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194898, 754578, 67152, '<td valign="top">the intensity of the processing and the scene itself is very engaging</td>', 'the intensity of the processing and the scene itself is very engaging', '2009-01-16 09:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194901, 754386, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=41337" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">yanko</a> feel to it.  There is the perfect range of tones and I like the dof blurring out around her.</td>', 'This has a  yanko feel to it.  There is the perfect range of tones and I like the dof blurring out around her.', '2009-01-16 09:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194902, 756604, 63398, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! Excellent job of exposure and processing to not have this blown out all over the place!!! Really well done! 8</td>', 'Wow!!! Excellent job of exposure and processing to not have this blown out all over the place!!! Really well done! 8', '2009-01-16 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194904, 754518, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful low key approach. This is a classic. 7</td>', 'Beautiful low key approach. This is a classic. 7', '2009-01-16 09:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194905, 755999, 32736, '<td valign="top">This needs more of a subject.</td>', 'This needs more of a subject.', '2009-01-16 09:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194908, 756361, 69368, '<td valign="top">this one made me smile!  Her expression is so funny!<br/>Why ever, reminds me to "miss little sunshine"</td>', 'this one made me smile!  Her expression is so funny!Why ever, reminds me to "miss little sunshine"', '2009-01-16 09:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194909, 756355, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the balance between the statue and the clipper ship. The juxtaposition between the old time mariner vessel and the modern one on the left is nice too but at the same time, if it weren''t there, it might be a bit less cluttered feeling if that makes sense. Pretty sky!</td>', 'I like the balance between the statue and the clipper ship. The juxtaposition between the old time mariner vessel and the modern one on the left is nice too but at the same time, if it weren''t there, it might be a bit less cluttered feeling if that makes sense. Pretty sky!', '2009-01-16 09:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194912, 755909, 67152, '<td valign="top">the sloped lines, the intricate details of the roof, the smooth almost painted like feel of the sky - it all pulls together nicely</td>', 'the sloped lines, the intricate details of the roof, the smooth almost painted like feel of the sky - it all pulls together nicely', '2009-01-16 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194913, 756510, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - perfect exposure and focus. It would even be pretty with the building in the background completely cropped out. LOL</td>', 'Wow - perfect exposure and focus. It would even be pretty with the building in the background completely cropped out. LOL', '2009-01-16 09:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194914, 755531, 63398, '<td valign="top">I love the swirls of the cobblestones. Nicelt seen and captured. Well done with the sun! 8</td>', 'I love the swirls of the cobblestones. Nicelt seen and captured. Well done with the sun! 8', '2009-01-16 09:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194915, 756614, 67152, '<td valign="top">a lovely scene for a walk towards sunset</td>', 'a lovely scene for a walk towards sunset', '2009-01-16 09:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194917, 756325, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of the city.  Is that New Orleans? no, the buildings are wrong.  Well, I love a fish eye view and the bike in the foreground and the wheel of the other one on the right help tie all of the people together. Nice.</td>', 'Love the sense of the city.  Is that New Orleans? no, the buildings are wrong.  Well, I love a fish eye view and the bike in the foreground and the wheel of the other one on the right help tie all of the people together. Nice.', '2009-01-16 09:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194918, 755686, 63398, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured &amp; processed! 8</td>', 'Beautifully captured & processed! 8', '2009-01-16 09:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194919, 756765, 67152, '<td valign="top">that is very in your face - actually...it is more ''on his face'' - i like the intensity of focus, the pose, and the choice of processing to give it an extra bit of edge</td>', 'that is very in your face - actually...it is more ''on his face'' - i like the intensity of focus, the pose, and the choice of processing to give it an extra bit of edge', '2009-01-16 09:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194922, 756428, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely postcard setting - i wish the image were a bit sharper in focus - much of the detail of the trees both in reflection and not seem lost here</td>', 'lovely postcard setting - i wish the image were a bit sharper in focus - much of the detail of the trees both in reflection and not seem lost here', '2009-01-16 09:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194926, 755598, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful eyes. To me, I''d love to see it in BW, but that''s just my taste. I like how her hair is blowing slightly in the wind. Did you over sharpen her eyes? 7</td>', 'Wonderful eyes. To me, I''d love to see it in BW, but that''s just my taste. I like how her hair is blowing slightly in the wind. Did you over sharpen her eyes? 7', '2009-01-16 09:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194929, 754939, 32736, '<td valign="top">Selective desat doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Selective desat doesn''t do it for me.', '2009-01-16 09:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194931, 755237, 67152, '<td valign="top">these guys are just so adorable - you have captured this little one in the perfect pose - happily sleeping all warm and snug in his sea otter coat</td>', 'these guys are just so adorable - you have captured this little one in the perfect pose - happily sleeping all warm and snug in his sea otter coat', '2009-01-16 09:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194932, 756413, 32736, '<td valign="top">This needs a subject.</td>', 'This needs a subject.', '2009-01-16 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194933, 754392, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my.  Talk about a perfect Christmas card. I think the only thing that hurts it is the antlers of another deer to the left.  I might have not done a square crop and just removed them by changing the shape of the image. Love the softness.</td>', 'Oh my.  Talk about a perfect Christmas card. I think the only thing that hurts it is the antlers of another deer to the left.  I might have not done a square crop and just removed them by changing the shape of the image. Love the softness.', '2009-01-16 09:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194934, 756541, 63398, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is really something! I don''t quite know what to say, really......10</td>', 'Wow! This is really something! I don''t quite know what to say, really......10', '2009-01-16 09:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194937, 756320, 67152, '<td valign="top">the low key approach here really accentuates the feel of a dream - the beauty of this image is the delicate soft appearance of the skin - outstanding</td>', 'the low key approach here really accentuates the feel of a dream - the beauty of this image is the delicate soft appearance of the skin - outstanding', '2009-01-16 09:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194940, 756697, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the editing (and the title).</td>', 'Love the editing (and the title).', '2009-01-16 09:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194942, 754541, 32736, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2009-01-16 09:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194944, 756042, 65592, '<td valign="top">Original and refreshing image. Well done.</td>', 'Original and refreshing image. Well done.', '2009-01-16 09:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194946, 754519, 32736, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the frontal lighting.</td>', 'I don''t like the frontal lighting.', '2009-01-16 09:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5194948, 756767, 79955, '<td valign="top">beautiful! lovely soft tones. 8</td>', 'beautiful! lovely soft tones. 8', '2009-01-16 09:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
