(5194975, 756749, 67152, '<td valign="top">the colors are so intense and the light so rich- i am just not sure i like the choice of perspective</td>', 'the colors are so intense and the light so rich- i am just not sure i like the choice of perspective', '2009-01-16 09:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
