(5195081, 754579, 67152, '<td valign="top">a postcard like scene - i wonder about the choice of crop and composition though - the very far left section of the image doesn''t seem to add much (especially the rock in the extreme lower left) - i wonder if setting up slightly to the right of your position could have emphasized the mountains even further<br/> <br/>i like the use of the log on the right to draw our attention in using the diagonal line without impacting the reflection of the mountain below, but i think that anchoring the scene on the right with the bright rocks in the water could really make this scene a winner</td>', 'a postcard like scene - i wonder about the choice of crop and composition though - the very far left section of the image doesn''t seem to add much (especially the rock in the extreme lower left) - i wonder if setting up slightly to the right of your position could have emphasized the mountains even further i like the use of the log on the right to draw our attention in using the diagonal line without impacting the reflection of the mountain below, but i think that anchoring the scene on the right with the bright rocks in the water could really make this scene a winner', '2009-01-16 10:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5195082, 755687, 67152, '<td valign="top">one of the most majestic valleys in the world<br/> <br/>i like the choice of wide crop to show the dynamic scene, but the light in this scene seems a bit too subdued - so that the trees and cliffs seems to meld together too much -  in addition, the image doesn''t quite seem sharp in focus throughout and the colors are a bit understated for such a dramatic location</td>', 'one of the most majestic valleys in the world i like the choice of wide crop to show the dynamic scene, but the light in this scene seems a bit too subdued - so that the trees and cliffs seems to meld together too much -  in addition, the image doesn''t quite seem sharp in focus throughout and the colors are a bit understated for such a dramatic location', '2009-01-16 10:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
