(5195178, 755019, 83080, '<td valign="top">WOW!!  OMG!!  I''ve been looking at this for a couple of minutes studying the scene, enjoying the powerful juxtaposition, and then (being a little slow I know) it just hit me like ton of bricks that you desaturated everythingn but the gay couple, illustrating how black &amp; white the anti-gay marriage viewpoint is.  There may be some technical imperfections to nitpick, but nothing that takes away from the powerful impact of how you composed and processed this.  I can''t wait to share your shot with my family/friends when the voting is over.</td>', 'WOW!!  OMG!!  I''ve been looking at this for a couple of minutes studying the scene, enjoying the powerful juxtaposition, and then (being a little slow I know) it just hit me like ton of bricks that you desaturated everythingn but the gay couple, illustrating how black & white the anti-gay marriage viewpoint is.  There may be some technical imperfections to nitpick, but nothing that takes away from the powerful impact of how you composed and processed this.  I can''t wait to share your shot with my family/friends when the voting is over.', '2009-01-16 10:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
