(5195778, 756695, 58457, '<td valign="top">Your overprocessing didn''t really help here, and will probably tank your score.  Most voters here don''t really like the surreal HDR look--I''m kind of in the middle.  I think your composition would''ve been helped by keeping the bridge tower off center.  It seems a bit static to me.</td>', 'Your overprocessing didn''t really help here, and will probably tank your score.  Most voters here don''t really like the surreal HDR look--I''m kind of in the middle.  I think your composition would''ve been helped by keeping the bridge tower off center.  It seems a bit static to me.', '2009-01-16 13:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
