(5195780, 756103, 67152, '<td valign="top">the high contrast created by the rocks and ice/ snow provide this a lot of interest - i am just not convinced of the crop - it seems the top of the image (clouds/sky) is not adding a lot to the scene.  cropping out half the sky currently present would move the horizon higher and focus our attention more on the textures and colors</td>', 'the high contrast created by the rocks and ice/ snow provide this a lot of interest - i am just not convinced of the crop - it seems the top of the image (clouds/sky) is not adding a lot to the scene.  cropping out half the sky currently present would move the horizon higher and focus our attention more on the textures and colors', '2009-01-16 13:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
