(5198023, 754605, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent shot -the details of the sawdust, the motion created by the lathe, the intensity of focus seen without being seen - it provides a great study of the artisan</td>', 'excellent shot -the details of the sawdust, the motion created by the lathe, the intensity of focus seen without being seen - it provides a great study of the artisan', '2009-01-17 06:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198025, 756698, 67152, '<td valign="top">herons are sure lovely birds - this one seems a bit lost in the grasses due to non-ideal lighting - and the necessary sharp focus to really separate the bird from the background seems to be missing as if it was taken with a slow shutter speed</td>', 'herons are sure lovely birds - this one seems a bit lost in the grasses due to non-ideal lighting - and the necessary sharp focus to really separate the bird from the background seems to be missing as if it was taken with a slow shutter speed', '2009-01-17 06:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198026, 756407, 67152, '<td valign="top">that is one awesome bird - and a really good photo of it as well - the focus on the eye and beak is right on the money - i just wonder if a slightly different crop to avoid it being so centered could have even made this a bit better - it might be possible to crop out/ clone out a few of the small branches to further highlight this cool colored bird</td>', 'that is one awesome bird - and a really good photo of it as well - the focus on the eye and beak is right on the money - i just wonder if a slightly different crop to avoid it being so centered could have even made this a bit better - it might be possible to crop out/ clone out a few of the small branches to further highlight this cool colored bird', '2009-01-17 06:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198027, 756712, 67152, '<td valign="top">funny perspective shot of the camel - the nose in focus sure is an interesting approach and one that works pretty well</td>', 'funny perspective shot of the camel - the nose in focus sure is an interesting approach and one that works pretty well', '2009-01-17 06:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198028, 756249, 67152, '<td valign="top">a very cool structure - it is very cool how we can see the world around us from this mirrored ball</td>', 'a very cool structure - it is very cool how we can see the world around us from this mirrored ball', '2009-01-17 07:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198030, 755573, 67152, '<td valign="top">the very natural colors, the soft dappled light from the trees above, the underbrush reclaiming the land, the gentle sloping path to the far right - all very nice elements - a nice effort</td>', 'the very natural colors, the soft dappled light from the trees above, the underbrush reclaiming the land, the gentle sloping path to the far right - all very nice elements - a nice effort', '2009-01-17 07:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198031, 754744, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely approach to a family picture - the background is a bit distracting with the wrinkles seeming to take a bit of attention away from the scene -maybe separating the three from the background a bit more may have been in order - also, the hand of the baby seems to be a bit blurry</td>', 'lovely approach to a family picture - the background is a bit distracting with the wrinkles seeming to take a bit of attention away from the scene -maybe separating the three from the background a bit more may have been in order - also, the hand of the baby seems to be a bit blurry', '2009-01-17 07:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198032, 756409, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting on the woman''s face a lot - she really seems to glow - i just worry that the lighting on the man and the belly are a bit unbalanced</td>', 'i like the lighting on the woman''s face a lot - she really seems to glow - i just worry that the lighting on the man and the belly are a bit unbalanced', '2009-01-17 07:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198035, 754440, 67152, '<td valign="top">the light on the city below and the hills beyond is really nice - but there are the typical pixelation issues in the details that are often seen with tonemapping</td>', 'the light on the city below and the hills beyond is really nice - but there are the typical pixelation issues in the details that are often seen with tonemapping', '2009-01-17 07:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198037, 756478, 67152, '<td valign="top">the glow of the soft light from the woods, the soft rich colors of the greens, and the misty path that leads us in - very good work</td>', 'the glow of the soft light from the woods, the soft rich colors of the greens, and the misty path that leads us in - very good work', '2009-01-17 07:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198039, 756343, 67152, '<td valign="top">man do those two look angry....<br/> <br/>the unusual approach really keeps me looking - bold effort</td>', 'man do those two look angry.... the unusual approach really keeps me looking - bold effort', '2009-01-17 07:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198070, 754914, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like your processing/the colors.</td>', '8 - Like your processing/the colors.', '2009-01-17 08:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198071, 756735, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Pretty awesome scene.. really like how you''ve captured the ''far ends'' and the shadows and light play around there.  I like this image also without the ''watcher'' - but another image.  I don''t know if it is just a visual perspective thing, but the ridges in the mountains seem tilted.  The only other nit pick, is the fore left green - does add further scale and perspective (not the same as I just mentioned), but perhaps more or none shown, if you had it of course - but your call, obviously.  Hope all that makes sense.  Like your title too.</td>', '7 - Pretty awesome scene.. really like how you''ve captured the ''far ends'' and the shadows and light play around there.  I like this image also without the ''watcher'' - but another image.  I don''t know if it is just a visual perspective thing, but the ridges in the mountains seem tilted.  The only other nit pick, is the fore left green - does add further scale and perspective (not the same as I just mentioned), but perhaps more or none shown, if you had it of course - but your call, obviously.  Hope all that makes sense.  Like your title too.', '2009-01-17 08:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198072, 754392, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice, and cute - I like your processing and the softness too, I like the ''fore bokeh'', the colors, the pose - what is baffling me is why you wouldn''t crop out the antlers and ... white ''something'' on the left there...</td>', '6 - Nice, and cute - I like your processing and the softness too, I like the ''fore bokeh'', the colors, the pose - what is baffling me is why you wouldn''t crop out the antlers and ... white ''something'' on the left there...', '2009-01-17 08:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198075, 756408, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Ha, cute, good title - overall wish it was a little ''brighter''...</td>', '5 - Ha, cute, good title - overall wish it was a little ''brighter''...', '2009-01-17 08:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198077, 755245, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  I like your balance and the ''fading'' effect captured.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  I like your balance and the ''fading'' effect captured.', '2009-01-17 08:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198100, 756758, 2764, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  After the challenge is over, this would look great with some funky processing.  It''s dark, and dark images always suffer from "poor voter monitor calibration" syndrome.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  After the challenge is over, this would look great with some funky processing.  It''s dark, and dark images always suffer from "poor voter monitor calibration" syndrome.', '2009-01-17 09:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198104, 756190, 2764, '<td valign="top">Lovely girls, not such a lovely photo.  It COULD be a great photo though.  Maybe a tighter crop and certainly fix the white balance issues.  If you can''t get rid of the yellow cast, try black and white.  It might be stunning in BW.</td>', 'Lovely girls, not such a lovely photo.  It COULD be a great photo though.  Maybe a tighter crop and certainly fix the white balance issues.  If you can''t get rid of the yellow cast, try black and white.  It might be stunning in BW.', '2009-01-17 09:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198106, 756619, 66709, '<td valign="top">Water is to slow for my taste</td>', 'Water is to slow for my taste', '2009-01-17 09:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198107, 754361, 2764, '<td valign="top">Yep - all you need is superman in the sky.  Beautiful image.  Amazing how you got the sunset, the stoem, the night lights and the car trails all in one picture.</td>', 'Yep - all you need is superman in the sky.  Beautiful image.  Amazing how you got the sunset, the stoem, the night lights and the car trails all in one picture.', '2009-01-17 09:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198110, 755319, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m left brained, what IS it.  ANd how did the number three get there?  on the other hand, as a bizarre abstract it is stunning.</td>', 'Ok, I''m left brained, what IS it.  ANd how did the number three get there?  on the other hand, as a bizarre abstract it is stunning.', '2009-01-17 09:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198112, 756751, 2764, '<td valign="top">Whoa, he''s huge.  Great capture, you really emphasize his bulk and power, then put him in a playful setting, clever.</td>', 'Whoa, he''s huge.  Great capture, you really emphasize his bulk and power, then put him in a playful setting, clever.', '2009-01-17 09:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5198119, 756242, 98339, '<td valign="top">good clear focus</td>', 'good clear focus', '2009-01-17 09:17:32.000000', NULL, 1);
