(5198857, 756425, 15204, '<td valign="top">Love the expression.  I like how you can just see her blue eyes inside those big goggles.  I normally don''t like the centered, head-in-a-box kind of composition for close-ups, but I think it works here.  The processing is pretty flat and cool, but again maybe that works here too.  Cool shot.</td>', 'Love the expression.  I like how you can just see her blue eyes inside those big goggles.  I normally don''t like the centered, head-in-a-box kind of composition for close-ups, but I think it works here.  The processing is pretty flat and cool, but again maybe that works here too.  Cool shot.', '2009-01-17 12:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
