(5199479, 754769, 45475, '<td valign="top">The pedigree of honey<br/>Does not concern the bee;<br/>A clover, any time, to him<br/>Is aristocracy.<br/> <i>- emily dickinson</i> <br/> <br/>Apart from the small fact that this is a killer bee macro (that''s, killer <i>pause</i> bee macro - not, killer bee <i>pause</i> macro), the colour is so fantastically wild and different to the norm, I can''t help but be swept away.<br/> <br/>Go you good thang! May your score soar ;) <br/> <br/>[no vote]</td>', 'The pedigree of honeyDoes not concern the bee;A clover, any time, to himIs aristocracy. - emily dickinson  Apart from the small fact that this is a killer bee macro (that''s, killer pause bee macro - not, killer bee pause macro), the colour is so fantastically wild and different to the norm, I can''t help but be swept away. Go you good thang! May your score soar ;)  [no vote]', '2009-01-17 15:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
