(5199566, 755368, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - This has potential, depending what you had to work with, rotating and cropping out the dog toy and then creating an effect of either b&amp;w or sepia in pp (post processing) may have given this an edge.  The whites on the dog''s face are overexposed, due to (what appears to be) the flash - again, effects in pp may have ''hidden'' that.</td>', '3 - This has potential, depending what you had to work with, rotating and cropping out the dog toy and then creating an effect of either b&w or sepia in pp (post processing) may have given this an edge.  The whites on the dog''s face are overexposed, due to (what appears to be) the flash - again, effects in pp may have ''hidden'' that.', '2009-01-17 15:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
