(5199870, 756623, 81362, '<td valign="top">I am enjoying how well you handled the sky and clouds. As a composition, the winding trail provides the most interest. I have a hard time deciding if this is mostly about the trail, or mostly about the vast broad landscape with big sky and endless cacti. From this vantage point, putting emphasis on the trail might work wello (using a portrait crop). Wonder if there was an opportunity during shooting to step to the right enough to make the path more of a diagonal element.</td>', 'I am enjoying how well you handled the sky and clouds. As a composition, the winding trail provides the most interest. I have a hard time deciding if this is mostly about the trail, or mostly about the vast broad landscape with big sky and endless cacti. From this vantage point, putting emphasis on the trail might work wello (using a portrait crop). Wonder if there was an opportunity during shooting to step to the right enough to make the path more of a diagonal element.', '2009-01-17 17:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199872, 756462, 92577, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2009-01-17 17:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
