(5199894, 756757, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good capture of spontaneous activity. The girls add a dynamic sense of motion (looking for sure, considering jumping over maybe). While the others on the street add context, The umbrella does echo color in the girls, but I wonder how this would look recropped to just barely exclude all people except the three girls.</td>', 'Good capture of spontaneous activity. The girls add a dynamic sense of motion (looking for sure, considering jumping over maybe). While the others on the street add context, The umbrella does echo color in the girls, but I wonder how this would look recropped to just barely exclude all people except the three girls.', '2009-01-17 17:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5199895, 755897, 30454, '<td valign="top">Nice one in the series. But I still think the recent ribbon photo(yours??) was better. Good Luck.</td>', 'Nice one in the series. But I still think the recent ribbon photo(yours??) was better. Good Luck.', '2009-01-17 17:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
