(5199930, 755163, 30454, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what photographer wants to convey here except the fact that it''s a nude shot with reasonably good lighting. Sorry doesn''t work for me. One of my low vote.</td>', 'Don''t know what photographer wants to convey here except the fact that it''s a nude shot with reasonably good lighting. Sorry doesn''t work for me. One of my low vote.', '2009-01-17 17:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
