(5199936, 756647, 30454, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, coming back for comments. What kind of filter is that? Anyways, I don''t think this could be your best shot of the year. Either you are trying for brown or going too much out of the box.</td>', 'Voted earlier, coming back for comments. What kind of filter is that? Anyways, I don''t think this could be your best shot of the year. Either you are trying for brown or going too much out of the box.', '2009-01-17 17:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
