(5199940, 756599, 81362, '<td valign="top">Simplicity of white fabric and hidden hair, purity of light, and complexity of lipstick. Excellent image.</td>', 'Simplicity of white fabric and hidden hair, purity of light, and complexity of lipstick. Excellent image.', '2009-01-17 17:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
