(5201734, 754386, 97893, '<td valign="top">I have seen this on 1x and loved it! So, the impact second time will perhaps be a bit less. But nothing to subtract from the loveliness of the shot. 9???neigh 10.</td>', 'I have seen this on 1x and loved it! So, the impact second time will perhaps be a bit less. But nothing to subtract from the loveliness of the shot. 9???neigh 10.', '2009-01-18 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201735, 755927, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely details in the butterfly - the foreground and background bokeh really add to the shot</td>', 'lovely details in the butterfly - the foreground and background bokeh really add to the shot', '2009-01-18 11:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201736, 756615, 97893, '<td valign="top">Awesome macro!</td>', 'Awesome macro!', '2009-01-18 11:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201740, 754799, 67152, '<td valign="top">the intensity of sunrises on Haleakala are some of the most amazing sights in the world<br/> <br/>the lack of details in the clouds, the lack of ground in the foreground to anchor the shot, and the blown out sunlit area in the upper right take away from the overall effect of the image<br/> <br/>P.S.  I got your PM.  On the good side, i like the yellows and oranges you captured and think it conveys a nice sense of warmth. (still give it a 5)</td>', 'the intensity of sunrises on Haleakala are some of the most amazing sights in the world the lack of details in the clouds, the lack of ground in the foreground to anchor the shot, and the blown out sunlit area in the upper right take away from the overall effect of the image P.S.  I got your PM.  On the good side, i like the yellows and oranges you captured and think it conveys a nice sense of warmth. (still give it a 5)', '2009-01-18 11:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201749, 754645, 67152, '<td valign="top">the spindles of the branches, the turn of the head, the bright colors of the feathers - very cool interaction of shapes - i am just not sure about the choice of crop - the bit of growth in the top left is slightly distracting</td>', 'the spindles of the branches, the turn of the head, the bright colors of the feathers - very cool interaction of shapes - i am just not sure about the choice of crop - the bit of growth in the top left is slightly distracting', '2009-01-18 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201754, 755998, 76335, '<td valign="top">A great capture for sure, but I think the real prize is in the processing. I hope you share how you got this result.</td>', 'A great capture for sure, but I think the real prize is in the processing. I hope you share how you got this result.', '2009-01-18 11:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201755, 754453, 76335, '<td valign="top">Another familiar image, but no less impressive. Graet framing here.</td>', 'Another familiar image, but no less impressive. Graet framing here.', '2009-01-18 11:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201756, 756716, 76335, '<td valign="top">A bit more sharpness would have helped this. It''s certainly a great scene.</td>', 'A bit more sharpness would have helped this. It''s certainly a great scene.', '2009-01-18 11:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201757, 756013, 76335, '<td valign="top">The sky seems a little overworked, but a great scene anyway.</td>', 'The sky seems a little overworked, but a great scene anyway.', '2009-01-18 12:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201760, 756386, 67152, '<td valign="top">a very interesting take on composition - i can see the reason to fill the frame as much as possible with the non-horizontal horizon  - i like the lovely lighting and colors - but that perspective makes  me a bit dizzy!</td>', 'a very interesting take on composition - i can see the reason to fill the frame as much as possible with the non-horizontal horizon  - i like the lovely lighting and colors - but that perspective makes  me a bit dizzy!', '2009-01-18 12:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201763, 755241, 76335, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped out the upper right, but a great chaotic (but recognizable) pattern here.</td>', 'I might have cropped out the upper right, but a great chaotic (but recognizable) pattern here.', '2009-01-18 12:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201766, 754498, 76335, '<td valign="top">Powerful, very professional result. Expert job with the lighting.</td>', 'Powerful, very professional result. Expert job with the lighting.', '2009-01-18 12:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
