(5201771, 754761, 67152, '<td valign="top">very cool how water forms so many shapes when objects are dropped in - the colors emphasize the cool feel - and i like how the cherry is deeper in color<br/> <br/>don''t forget that you can clone out sensor dust and other little distracting bits - these take a bit away from the shot</td>', 'very cool how water forms so many shapes when objects are dropped in - the colors emphasize the cool feel - and i like how the cherry is deeper in color don''t forget that you can clone out sensor dust and other little distracting bits - these take a bit away from the shot', '2009-01-18 12:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201773, 755130, 67152, '<td valign="top">the details in the face and the hair are really accentuated by the choice of b/w - i wish his eyes were a bit brighter (but not much!)</td>', 'the details in the face and the hair are really accentuated by the choice of b/w - i wish his eyes were a bit brighter (but not much!)', '2009-01-18 12:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
