(5201790, 755785, 67152, '<td valign="top">the explosion of lines of light really give this a great dizzying feel - and the couple in the bottom corner really anchor the shot</td>', 'the explosion of lines of light really give this a great dizzying feel - and the couple in the bottom corner really anchor the shot', '2009-01-18 12:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
