(5201853, 756626, 2764, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and color, almost a great photo.  First, dark is risky - you are likely to lose a point from "poor voter monitor calibration syndrome".  Second, I think there is too much "other stuff" in the picture which a tighter crop could eliminate.  If I just see the flower reaching sideways and the rocks under water, then the image is stunning.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and color, almost a great photo.  First, dark is risky - you are likely to lose a point from "poor voter monitor calibration syndrome".  Second, I think there is too much "other stuff" in the picture which a tighter crop could eliminate.  If I just see the flower reaching sideways and the rocks under water, then the image is stunning.', '2009-01-18 13:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5201854, 755892, 68586, '<td valign="top">Wow - I wish I had dreams like that when I had a Fever !!<br/> <br/> :- )</td>', 'Wow - I wish I had dreams like that when I had a Fever !!  :- )', '2009-01-18 13:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
