(5202366, 756046, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely summer scene - the water and mountain do a lovely job of framing the boat - i just wonder if a slightly tighter crop on the right is in order (the  post could easily be removed with no loss of perspective)</td>', 'lovely summer scene - the water and mountain do a lovely job of framing the boat - i just wonder if a slightly tighter crop on the right is in order (the  post could easily be removed with no loss of perspective)', '2009-01-18 16:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
