(5202440, 755572, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wish the focus on the actual subject were more clear.  I''m torn between the writing on the tire and the shoe.</td>', 'Wish the focus on the actual subject were more clear.  I''m torn between the writing on the tire and the shoe.', '2009-01-18 17:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
