(5202773, 756719, 67152, '<td valign="top">a great pose and a good expression - i like how the door frame provides a focal point to the bride - her teeth are just a bit toooooo bright though</td>', 'a great pose and a good expression - i like how the door frame provides a focal point to the bride - her teeth are just a bit toooooo bright though', '2009-01-18 19:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202774, 754520, 20364, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast and rich color.  9.</td>', 'Very nice contrast and rich color.  9.', '2009-01-18 19:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202775, 755261, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of leading lines, and a beautiful scene. Love the egg yolk colored sky.</td>', 'Excellent use of leading lines, and a beautiful scene. Love the egg yolk colored sky.', '2009-01-18 19:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202777, 756599, 76335, '<td valign="top">Stark, almost frightening. Great job controlling the light.</td>', 'Stark, almost frightening. Great job controlling the light.', '2009-01-18 19:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202778, 756293, 20364, '<td valign="top">Superman''s Fortress of Solitude has nothing over this.  Great photo!!!  9.</td>', 'Superman''s Fortress of Solitude has nothing over this.  Great photo!!!  9.', '2009-01-18 19:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202779, 756769, 67152, '<td valign="top">that is crazy how tight those cars run - the slope of the line allows our eyes to follow the path - but for some reason there is something that is missing that I can''t quite put my finger on - motion implied, the cars going away from us, something....</td>', 'that is crazy how tight those cars run - the slope of the line allows our eyes to follow the path - but for some reason there is something that is missing that I can''t quite put my finger on - motion implied, the cars going away from us, something....', '2009-01-18 19:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202780, 756524, 67152, '<td valign="top">almost a sketch more than a photograph - i like the feel of it a lot</td>', 'almost a sketch more than a photograph - i like the feel of it a lot', '2009-01-18 19:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202783, 755518, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''ll always score good, even decent, astrophotography high, because I have such envy and respect for those who can do it. This is very good. I wish I had studied astronomy...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-23 07:32:32.</i></td>', 'I''ll always score good, even decent, astrophotography high, because I have such envy and respect for those who can do it. This is very good. I wish I had studied astronomy...', '2009-01-18 19:47:01.000000', '2009-01-23 07:32:32.000000', 1),
(5202784, 756735, 100773, '<td valign="top">That looked like a fantasyworld. Very, very beautifull.</td>', 'That looked like a fantasyworld. Very, very beautifull.', '2009-01-18 19:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202785, 754568, 22459, '<td valign="top">the joy of the carnival ? or is it?? brilliant image.</td>', 'the joy of the carnival ? or is it?? brilliant image.', '2009-01-18 19:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202786, 755598, 67152, '<td valign="top">outstanding lighting on her face - the composition with the slight tilt is great and the wisps of hair about her head is very attractive - but i am not a fan of the eyes at all - extremely overdone in my opinion</td>', 'outstanding lighting on her face - the composition with the slight tilt is great and the wisps of hair about her head is very attractive - but i am not a fan of the eyes at all - extremely overdone in my opinion', '2009-01-18 19:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202787, 755197, 76335, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve covered the whole spectrum! A beautiful scene.</td>', 'I think you''ve covered the whole spectrum! A beautiful scene.', '2009-01-18 19:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202788, 754859, 67152, '<td valign="top">live action wildlife shots are sure hard to get - and you have captured a nice story - but the image seems a bit overexposed throughout</td>', 'live action wildlife shots are sure hard to get - and you have captured a nice story - but the image seems a bit overexposed throughout', '2009-01-18 19:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202790, 756612, 67152, '<td valign="top">the clouds provide a wonderful set of textures to the shot - there are some pixelation issues in the rocks in the foreground that do detract a bit</td>', 'the clouds provide a wonderful set of textures to the shot - there are some pixelation issues in the rocks in the foreground that do detract a bit', '2009-01-18 19:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202792, 756507, 67152, '<td valign="top">the perfect title for this one - i was about to mention that word when I saw the image - the smile, the eye barely visible, the motion of the hair - a great shot</td>', 'the perfect title for this one - i was about to mention that word when I saw the image - the smile, the eye barely visible, the motion of the hair - a great shot', '2009-01-18 19:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202797, 754526, 100773, '<td valign="top">Good detail: You actually were check mate. I learned a new check move too, thanks!</td>', 'Good detail: You actually were check mate. I learned a new check move too, thanks!', '2009-01-18 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202808, 756654, 22459, '<td valign="top">great image, love how you have got right into this wave.</td>', 'great image, love how you have got right into this wave.', '2009-01-18 19:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202809, 755574, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the vision to put the cloud in the sky through the reflection - but the noise levels in the image are a pretty significant issue here</td>', 'i like the vision to put the cloud in the sky through the reflection - but the noise levels in the image are a pretty significant issue here', '2009-01-18 19:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202810, 755227, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a location - i like the framing with the trees around, the vertical crop to help imply the height, and the warm rich light on the image</td>', 'what a location - i like the framing with the trees around, the vertical crop to help imply the height, and the warm rich light on the image', '2009-01-18 19:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202813, 756658, 67152, '<td valign="top">the splash and the tail fin are well captured - these gentle giants are amazing and you did a nice job to show their power</td>', 'the splash and the tail fin are well captured - these gentle giants are amazing and you did a nice job to show their power', '2009-01-18 19:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202816, 755006, 67152, '<td valign="top">the rays of light and the choice of sepia is outstanding - staying away from a high contrast edit is noble as this gives a warmer and more dream like feel - good work</td>', 'the rays of light and the choice of sepia is outstanding - staying away from a high contrast edit is noble as this gives a warmer and more dream like feel - good work', '2009-01-18 19:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202817, 755087, 69246, '<td valign="top">Good use of available light. It really makes this photo stand out.</td>', 'Good use of available light. It really makes this photo stand out.', '2009-01-18 19:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202818, 755897, 100773, '<td valign="top">I hope I''ll be able to shoot a bald eagle too... They''re such magnificent creatures. Very lucky with the... batman... spreadwings kinda thing. Good shot!</td>', 'I hope I''ll be able to shoot a bald eagle too... They''re such magnificent creatures. Very lucky with the... batman... spreadwings kinda thing. Good shot!', '2009-01-18 19:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202819, 756112, 67152, '<td valign="top">the downward glance, the low key lighting to emphasize her slim line, the bright bow to show innocence - very nicely put together</td>', 'the downward glance, the low key lighting to emphasize her slim line, the bright bow to show innocence - very nicely put together', '2009-01-18 19:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202820, 754878, 69246, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of a vanishing point. The birds are an extra bonus which adds a bit of life to this.</td>', 'Excellent use of a vanishing point. The birds are an extra bonus which adds a bit of life to this.', '2009-01-18 19:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202822, 756729, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent city image - the title, the person, the for sale sign - it really drives home the message of the rough world we live in</td>', 'excellent city image - the title, the person, the for sale sign - it really drives home the message of the rough world we live in', '2009-01-18 20:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202823, 754523, 69246, '<td valign="top">Its just not a clear photo. Looks as though it was taken through glass.</td>', 'Its just not a clear photo. Looks as though it was taken through glass.', '2009-01-18 20:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202825, 754338, 67152, '<td valign="top">a beautiful baby and a lovely portrait - the softness of the image mostly works here - but i wish the eyes were a bit better focuses and i wish the arm or whatever the baby is resting on was not present</td>', 'a beautiful baby and a lovely portrait - the softness of the image mostly works here - but i wish the eyes were a bit better focuses and i wish the arm or whatever the baby is resting on was not present', '2009-01-18 20:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202828, 756520, 67152, '<td valign="top">Simply outstanding - among the best images in the challenge - the low key light is perfect placed on the eyes - the window to this animals world</td>', 'Simply outstanding - among the best images in the challenge - the low key light is perfect placed on the eyes - the window to this animals world', '2009-01-18 20:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202829, 755431, 69246, '<td valign="top">Normally, I vote low on exaggerated tilts. But, in this case, the tilt works. In fact, its one of the few cases where a tilt is used correctly. In other words, I really like this shot!!!</td>', 'Normally, I vote low on exaggerated tilts. But, in this case, the tilt works. In fact, its one of the few cases where a tilt is used correctly. In other words, I really like this shot!!!', '2009-01-18 20:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202830, 756355, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely image - composed so nicely - it was worth the wait, huh?</td>', 'lovely image - composed so nicely - it was worth the wait, huh?', '2009-01-18 20:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202831, 755812, 67585, '<td valign="top">Different.  I really like this.</td>', 'Different.  I really like this.', '2009-01-18 20:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202833, 755880, 67152, '<td valign="top">the energy of the hammer, the glow of the shoe, the grip of the hand - excellent image</td>', 'the energy of the hammer, the glow of the shoe, the grip of the hand - excellent image', '2009-01-18 20:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202834, 756597, 100773, '<td valign="top">Seriously... Some of you guys''n''gals must''ve tamed eagle types to come and pose for you whenever you feel like it. I don''t know if I can stand another eagle, shot with a 70-200mm lens... THIS BETTER BE SHOT WITH SOMETHING BIGGER! Full score from me....</td>', 'Seriously... Some of you guys''n''gals must''ve tamed eagle types to come and pose for you whenever you feel like it. I don''t know if I can stand another eagle, shot with a 70-200mm lens... THIS BETTER BE SHOT WITH SOMETHING BIGGER! Full score from me....', '2009-01-18 20:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202836, 754391, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a cool job of seeing the possibilities of this shot - and the patience to wait for the right moment</td>', 'what a cool job of seeing the possibilities of this shot - and the patience to wait for the right moment', '2009-01-18 20:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202837, 756672, 67152, '<td valign="top">fantastic composition and lighting - it really provides just the right pop of the colors to draw us in</td>', 'fantastic composition and lighting - it really provides just the right pop of the colors to draw us in', '2009-01-18 20:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202838, 756757, 67152, '<td valign="top">one of my favorite street shots I have seen this year - "do I jump in or not?"</td>', 'one of my favorite street shots I have seen this year - "do I jump in or not?"', '2009-01-18 20:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202840, 755019, 69246, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of paradox! Lighting could have been better, but, sometimes you have to take what you got to get a shot like this. Scoring high for the photojournalistic quality.</td>', 'Excellent use of paradox! Lighting could have been better, but, sometimes you have to take what you got to get a shot like this. Scoring high for the photojournalistic quality.', '2009-01-18 20:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202841, 755545, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is the second shot I''ve seen of Castle Hill Light in this challange.  What a great place to shoot (one of my favorite lighthouses in the whole world!).  This is really a super shot.  Nice work!</td>', 'This is the second shot I''ve seen of Castle Hill Light in this challange.  What a great place to shoot (one of my favorite lighthouses in the whole world!).  This is really a super shot.  Nice work!', '2009-01-18 20:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202842, 754840, 67152, '<td valign="top">the perspective and composition really hold our attention - and the lighting from the side provides us a way to see the exquisite detail in the columns</td>', 'the perspective and composition really hold our attention - and the lighting from the side provides us a way to see the exquisite detail in the columns', '2009-01-18 20:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202843, 755367, 67152, '<td valign="top">i do too!  great portrait - very relaxed, very realistic, and very well done</td>', 'i do too!  great portrait - very relaxed, very realistic, and very well done', '2009-01-18 20:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202846, 756634, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is the second shot I''ve seen of Castle Hill Light in this challange.  I really like the texture of the rocks and the colors here.  Nice work!</td>', 'This is the second shot I''ve seen of Castle Hill Light in this challange.  I really like the texture of the rocks and the colors here.  Nice work!', '2009-01-18 20:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202848, 754352, 67152, '<td valign="top">the sense of forever really overwhelms me with this shot - the sweep of the wash gives the image a ''now'' feel while the choice of b/w gives a feeling of long ago</td>', 'the sense of forever really overwhelms me with this shot - the sweep of the wash gives the image a ''now'' feel while the choice of b/w gives a feeling of long ago', '2009-01-18 20:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202850, 754345, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the composition with the city seen behind - i just with the lighting on the front of the car were a bit more pronounced</td>', 'i like the composition with the city seen behind - i just with the lighting on the front of the car were a bit more pronounced', '2009-01-18 20:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202851, 754752, 67152, '<td valign="top">an almost abstract like approach to sunset</td>', 'an almost abstract like approach to sunset', '2009-01-18 20:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202852, 755883, 67152, '<td valign="top">the focus of dogs to get the ball or other toy is so fascinating - and you really picked up on it nicely here</td>', 'the focus of dogs to get the ball or other toy is so fascinating - and you really picked up on it nicely here', '2009-01-18 20:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202853, 755897, 67152, '<td valign="top">a beautiful dance that the eagle has when going for its prey - wonderful</td>', 'a beautiful dance that the eagle has when going for its prey - wonderful', '2009-01-18 20:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202854, 755130, 100773, '<td valign="top">Very good and interesting shot. I''m just not sure about the title.</td>', 'Very good and interesting shot. I''m just not sure about the title.', '2009-01-18 20:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202855, 754881, 67152, '<td valign="top">the harsh feel of the ice, the blast of the surf, and the boil of the water in front - outstanding elements placed well together</td>', 'the harsh feel of the ice, the blast of the surf, and the boil of the water in front - outstanding elements placed well together', '2009-01-18 20:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202856, 755829, 69246, '<td valign="top">This belongs on the cover of TIME magazine. What an absolutely beautiful portrayal of the title! The look on the left child''s face brings this all in. Definately a photojournalistic timepiece! There are just so many comparisons to be made here. You really should submit this to a magazine for publication! Scoring very high and adding it tomy favorites!</td>', 'This belongs on the cover of TIME magazine. What an absolutely beautiful portrayal of the title! The look on the left child''s face brings this all in. Definately a photojournalistic timepiece! There are just so many comparisons to be made here. You really should submit this to a magazine for publication! Scoring very high and adding it tomy favorites!', '2009-01-18 20:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202860, 756673, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like how the eyes of the wolf are visible but that of the man are not</td>', 'i like how the eyes of the wolf are visible but that of the man are not', '2009-01-18 20:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202864, 756695, 67152, '<td valign="top">a cool vantage point for the bridge - but the tonemapping is completely overdone here with the extreme halo around the bridge throughout</td>', 'a cool vantage point for the bridge - but the tonemapping is completely overdone here with the extreme halo around the bridge throughout', '2009-01-18 20:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202865, 756351, 63269, '<td valign="top">The tones here are magnificent, and the sepia works great.</td>', 'The tones here are magnificent, and the sepia works great.', '2009-01-18 20:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202867, 756686, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a capture - the explosion of energy is so evident in the face of the cowboy</td>', 'what a capture - the explosion of energy is so evident in the face of the cowboy', '2009-01-18 20:13:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5202868, 756098, 63269, '<td valign="top">A little blurry, but beautiful lighting.</td>', 'A little blurry, but beautiful lighting.', '2009-01-18 20:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202869, 756034, 67152, '<td valign="top">beautiful and serene - a gorgeous work of art - and if i am not mistaken, it is Lanai in the background...</td>', 'beautiful and serene - a gorgeous work of art - and if i am not mistaken, it is Lanai in the background...', '2009-01-18 20:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202872, 756633, 69246, '<td valign="top">I''m listening to his music right now...its going to take a bit to grow on me. Good concert shot.</td>', 'I''m listening to his music right now...its going to take a bit to grow on me. Good concert shot.', '2009-01-18 20:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202874, 755482, 63269, '<td valign="top">I might suggest adding just a touch more contrast, but the colors are rich and lovely!</td>', 'I might suggest adding just a touch more contrast, but the colors are rich and lovely!', '2009-01-18 20:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202875, 754339, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very neat! The textures and colors are awesome.</td>', 'Very neat! The textures and colors are awesome.', '2009-01-18 20:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202877, 756408, 67152, '<td valign="top">a great title for a cool image - the outstretch arms really gives me a chuckle here - and the rich greens throughout provides a great living feel to the image</td>', 'a great title for a cool image - the outstretch arms really gives me a chuckle here - and the rich greens throughout provides a great living feel to the image', '2009-01-18 20:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202879, 756684, 77838, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp detail and awesome colors.  They are very comfortable.  The border is very complimentary to the photo. I like it alot. -BB</td>', 'Nice sharp detail and awesome colors.  They are very comfortable.  The border is very complimentary to the photo. I like it alot. -BB', '2009-01-18 20:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202881, 754599, 67152, '<td valign="top">a National Geographic image if I ever saw one - lovely colors and composition - that is the perfect perspective - down at their level, seeing what they see....</td>', 'a National Geographic image if I ever saw one - lovely colors and composition - that is the perfect perspective - down at their level, seeing what they see....', '2009-01-18 20:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202885, 756325, 67152, '<td valign="top">the superwide angle, with the band centered and the people mingling around really gives this a great feel - i just wish DPC came with a soundtrack....</td>', 'the superwide angle, with the band centered and the people mingling around really gives this a great feel - i just wish DPC came with a soundtrack....', '2009-01-18 20:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202886, 756695, 69246, '<td valign="top">The HDR halos really take a lot away from what is otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'The HDR halos really take a lot away from what is otherwise a good shot.', '2009-01-18 20:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202889, 755860, 63269, '<td valign="top">A little blurry, but then too I''m sure if <i>I</i> took a photo of a bear that close, I''d end up with a bunch of <i>completely </i>blurred shots. :D I''d also suggest a little more contrast and perhaps a different composition.</td>', 'A little blurry, but then too I''m sure if I took a photo of a bear that close, I''d end up with a bunch of completely blurred shots. :D I''d also suggest a little more contrast and perhaps a different composition.', '2009-01-18 20:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202894, 755970, 67152, '<td valign="top">the parade of people below the man and the boats beyond provide a wonderful sense of great drama</td>', 'the parade of people below the man and the boats beyond provide a wonderful sense of great drama', '2009-01-18 20:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202895, 754854, 63269, '<td valign="top">A little blurry, perhaps, but I love the mist!</td>', 'A little blurry, perhaps, but I love the mist!', '2009-01-18 20:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202896, 756728, 69246, '<td valign="top">Is this in Montanna? I went to an Avalanche Lake when I was working in Kalispell. This looks familiar. If it is, I have a very similar shot, and one of my favorites shooting the opposite direction.</td>', 'Is this in Montanna? I went to an Avalanche Lake when I was working in Kalispell. This looks familiar. If it is, I have a very similar shot, and one of my favorites shooting the opposite direction.', '2009-01-18 20:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202897, 756042, 63269, '<td valign="top">The fog, and the grain, give this a beautiful, solemn atmosphere.</td>', 'The fog, and the grain, give this a beautiful, solemn atmosphere.', '2009-01-18 20:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202899, 754498, 63269, '<td valign="top">STUNNING lighting.</td>', 'STUNNING lighting.', '2009-01-18 20:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202900, 754829, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really like this one - if i am not mistaken - i liked the other shot entered in an earlier challenge as well - very nice work - the blues are rich and the golds provide a nice contrast to the water</td>', 'i really like this one - if i am not mistaken - i liked the other shot entered in an earlier challenge as well - very nice work - the blues are rich and the golds provide a nice contrast to the water', '2009-01-18 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202902, 756608, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks a little out of focus, and a little grainy, perhaps, but the lighting is truely superb.</td>', 'This looks a little out of focus, and a little grainy, perhaps, but the lighting is truely superb.', '2009-01-18 20:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202904, 756554, 67152, '<td valign="top">an amazing vista - the image seems too dark in the foreground and the sky a bit too purple/blue for my taste</td>', 'an amazing vista - the image seems too dark in the foreground and the sky a bit too purple/blue for my taste', '2009-01-18 20:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202905, 756341, 77838, '<td valign="top">I love the setting and the framing here.  There''s a little noise in the dark colors of the background.  Nice pose also. -BB</td>', 'I love the setting and the framing here.  There''s a little noise in the dark colors of the background.  Nice pose also. -BB', '2009-01-18 20:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202908, 755418, 67152, '<td valign="top">fantastic capture - the lighting is perfect to emphasize his physique - it could easily be a magazine advert</td>', 'fantastic capture - the lighting is perfect to emphasize his physique - it could easily be a magazine advert', '2009-01-18 20:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202909, 754484, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally might have perfered a less tight crop, and I would also suggest a little more contrast to whiten up the highlights... but awesome capture!</td>', 'I personally might have perfered a less tight crop, and I would also suggest a little more contrast to whiten up the highlights... but awesome capture!', '2009-01-18 20:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202911, 756615, 63269, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity and detail.</td>', 'Amazing clarity and detail.', '2009-01-18 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202912, 756645, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lighting is dynamic and fantastic in the upper left - the overly processed colors and tonemapped feel of the foreground does not work for me at all</td>', 'the lighting is dynamic and fantastic in the upper left - the overly processed colors and tonemapped feel of the foreground does not work for me at all', '2009-01-18 20:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202914, 754442, 63269, '<td valign="top">the composition, with all the harsh highlights and shadows, does not particularly appeal to me, but the composition is interesting.</td>', 'the composition, with all the harsh highlights and shadows, does not particularly appeal to me, but the composition is interesting.', '2009-01-18 20:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5202917, 756654, 67152, '<td valign="top">the abstract feel of this wave ready to crash on us - very cool!</td>', 'the abstract feel of this wave ready to crash on us - very cool!', '2009-01-18 20:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
