(5203283, 756707, 67152, '<td valign="top">a lovely landscape all around - the path leading us in, the beautiful cumulus clouds, the prairie with the hills behind - all well composed<br/> <br/>the sky is a large problem in my opinion - it is splotched in an odd way - with dark spots in the upper sections of the scene - i feel these could easily be fixed with a gentle hand - and well worth it for this image</td>', 'a lovely landscape all around - the path leading us in, the beautiful cumulus clouds, the prairie with the hills behind - all well composed the sky is a large problem in my opinion - it is splotched in an odd way - with dark spots in the upper sections of the scene - i feel these could easily be fixed with a gentle hand - and well worth it for this image', '2009-01-19 05:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203286, 756213, 67152, '<td valign="top">the background glows and the light on the horse really amplifies the lines - a good study of motion</td>', 'the background glows and the light on the horse really amplifies the lines - a good study of motion', '2009-01-19 05:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203289, 755477, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely scene - the light in the clouds is my favorite element in the image - i just wonder if the city and water is slightly oversharpened</td>', 'lovely scene - the light in the clouds is my favorite element in the image - i just wonder if the city and water is slightly oversharpened', '2009-01-19 05:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203290, 756748, 67152, '<td valign="top">really good macro - the lines, the curl of the leaves - very nice</td>', 'really good macro - the lines, the curl of the leaves - very nice', '2009-01-19 05:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203292, 754340, 67152, '<td valign="top">fantastic emotive shot - the grip of these little ones is so amazing<br/> <br/>you have composed this in an outstanding way, how the arm of the baby curls around and forms an S shape with dad''s hand - very very good</td>', 'fantastic emotive shot - the grip of these little ones is so amazing you have composed this in an outstanding way, how the arm of the baby curls around and forms an S shape with dad''s hand - very very good', '2009-01-19 05:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203295, 756145, 67152, '<td valign="top">the soft light on the rocks in the foreground, the mist created by the long exposure of the water - very nice</td>', 'the soft light on the rocks in the foreground, the mist created by the long exposure of the water - very nice', '2009-01-19 06:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203296, 755096, 67152, '<td valign="top">a cool negative to emphasize the shapes</td>', 'a cool negative to emphasize the shapes', '2009-01-19 06:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203298, 756687, 67152, '<td valign="top">simple and emotive - the partially desaturated feel emphasizes the new growth</td>', 'simple and emotive - the partially desaturated feel emphasizes the new growth', '2009-01-19 06:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203300, 756711, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the centered crop and filled frame - i wish with the focus were just a wee bit sharper in the eyes</td>', 'i like the centered crop and filled frame - i wish with the focus were just a wee bit sharper in the eyes', '2009-01-19 06:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203303, 756469, 67152, '<td valign="top">the low angle light really gives the ground, the road, and the trees a lovely feel - i just wish the sun were not as blown (but i understand why it is) - maybe a slightly different angle so the road heads back a bit more left to right would have reduced the impact of the sun</td>', 'the low angle light really gives the ground, the road, and the trees a lovely feel - i just wish the sun were not as blown (but i understand why it is) - maybe a slightly different angle so the road heads back a bit more left to right would have reduced the impact of the sun', '2009-01-19 06:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203304, 754939, 67152, '<td valign="top">a cute, relaxed, and flirty expression - the partial desat does emphasize her - but i am not crazy about the downward perspective</td>', 'a cute, relaxed, and flirty expression - the partial desat does emphasize her - but i am not crazy about the downward perspective', '2009-01-19 06:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203305, 756498, 67152, '<td valign="top">the textures are amplified nicely in the choice of b/w - an insightful and calm face, showing wisdom of the years</td>', 'the textures are amplified nicely in the choice of b/w - an insightful and calm face, showing wisdom of the years', '2009-01-19 06:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203308, 756190, 67152, '<td valign="top">three very pretty young girls - they look like good friends - and this will be a great keepsake for them<br/> <br/>the shot itself has some issues with a busy and distracting background, harsh light due to the flash, and the fact that the girl to the right is partially hidden - in addition, the two girls on the sides appear to be uncertain about smiling (as if saying "cheese"), while the girl in the middle has a natural and calm expression</td>', 'three very pretty young girls - they look like good friends - and this will be a great keepsake for them the shot itself has some issues with a busy and distracting background, harsh light due to the flash, and the fact that the girl to the right is partially hidden - in addition, the two girls on the sides appear to be uncertain about smiling (as if saying "cheese"), while the girl in the middle has a natural and calm expression', '2009-01-19 06:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203367, 756328, 52285, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm ... that''s intresting ...</td>', 'Hmmmm ... that''s intresting ...', '2009-01-19 07:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203376, 756192, 67152, '<td valign="top">the curved lines of the wave and how they capture both the golds, whites and darks together is very good - but i am not crazy about a complete lack of sharpness here</td>', 'the curved lines of the wave and how they capture both the golds, whites and darks together is very good - but i am not crazy about a complete lack of sharpness here', '2009-01-19 07:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203379, 756727, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool insect - the details in the face and leaf below are very good - but the way the image appears to almost be split in two by the positioning of the shot takes away a bit for me</td>', 'cool insect - the details in the face and leaf below are very good - but the way the image appears to almost be split in two by the positioning of the shot takes away a bit for me', '2009-01-19 07:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
