(5203384, 756044, 67152, '<td valign="top">the grays of the image really emphasize the layers created by the scene - the foreground grasses, the river loping through the scene, the foothills and mountains beyond, and the layers of clouds above<br/> <br/>the image does give the strange impression of not being straight with respect to the horizon - it may be the mountains, or it may be tilted - hard to tell....</td>', 'the grays of the image really emphasize the layers created by the scene - the foreground grasses, the river loping through the scene, the foothills and mountains beyond, and the layers of clouds above the image does give the strange impression of not being straight with respect to the horizon - it may be the mountains, or it may be tilted - hard to tell....', '2009-01-19 07:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5203386, 754507, 67152, '<td valign="top">very emotive - the young man watching from a distance really makes the shot IMO</td>', 'very emotive - the young man watching from a distance really makes the shot IMO', '2009-01-19 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
