(5204268, 755368, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very cute scene but there is some very harsh and inconsistent lighting. At 84k in size, your image also has a fair amount of compression. You probably lost a lot of detail to that JPEG compression. Always use the least amount of compression you can get away with and still sneak in under the file size limit for the challenge.</td>', 'A very cute scene but there is some very harsh and inconsistent lighting. At 84k in size, your image also has a fair amount of compression. You probably lost a lot of detail to that JPEG compression. Always use the least amount of compression you can get away with and still sneak in under the file size limit for the challenge.', '2009-01-19 13:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
