(5204793, 754460, 30861, '<td valign="top">WHY is this leaning to the left?</td>', 'WHY is this leaning to the left?', '2009-01-19 17:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204795, 756474, 30861, '<td valign="top">that''s very cool; took me a double-take to catch it...</td>', 'that''s very cool; took me a double-take to catch it...', '2009-01-19 17:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204804, 754559, 60495, '<td valign="top">I like the 2 people in the shot and the way the light in the two rooms adds interest and layers in the shot. It appears the crop was made to include the entire bright area of the ground but to me it may have looked a bit more balanced if the the doorway was leveled up and some of the right hand side cropped out.</td>', 'I like the 2 people in the shot and the way the light in the two rooms adds interest and layers in the shot. It appears the crop was made to include the entire bright area of the ground but to me it may have looked a bit more balanced if the the doorway was leveled up and some of the right hand side cropped out.', '2009-01-19 17:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204814, 755969, 60495, '<td valign="top">Colors on steroids! Pretty scene but I am not sure the saturation helped the shot.</td>', 'Colors on steroids! Pretty scene but I am not sure the saturation helped the shot.', '2009-01-19 17:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204827, 756654, 60495, '<td valign="top">That looks like a tough shot to capture, to bad the curl was not open just a tiny bit more to get more perspective.</td>', 'That looks like a tough shot to capture, to bad the curl was not open just a tiny bit more to get more perspective.', '2009-01-19 17:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204855, 755643, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shapes, dreamy, ethereal. Great exposure.</td>', 'Beautiful shapes, dreamy, ethereal. Great exposure.', '2009-01-19 17:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204857, 755104, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great pose and angle. The soft focus and natual light (?) is flattering.</td>', 'Great pose and angle. The soft focus and natual light (?) is flattering.', '2009-01-19 17:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204863, 756580, 76335, '<td valign="top">Harsh, stark, grainy, almost frightening. I like it!</td>', 'Harsh, stark, grainy, almost frightening. I like it!', '2009-01-19 17:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204868, 754526, 76335, '<td valign="top">Is this a Lensbaby image? Whatever it is, I like it. Very creative to blur the assailants!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-24 00:31:45.</i></td>', 'Is this a Lensbaby image? Whatever it is, I like it. Very creative to blur the assailants!', '2009-01-19 17:35:29.000000', '2009-01-24 00:31:45.000000', 1),
(5204870, 756258, 76335, '<td valign="top">A good portrait, but the lighting seems a bit harsh, most obvious on the corner of the lip and the eye.</td>', 'A good portrait, but the lighting seems a bit harsh, most obvious on the corner of the lip and the eye.', '2009-01-19 17:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204872, 756351, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great angle and sepia processing. The vignette was smart.</td>', 'Great angle and sepia processing. The vignette was smart.', '2009-01-19 17:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204875, 755561, 76335, '<td valign="top">Stunning, otherworldly. Sky''s a bit grainy, but this has to be a challenging shot. Good work.</td>', 'Stunning, otherworldly. Sky''s a bit grainy, but this has to be a challenging shot. Good work.', '2009-01-19 17:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204877, 754576, 81280, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazing reflection shot.</td>', 'Wow! Amazing reflection shot.', '2009-01-19 17:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204878, 756408, 81280, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot</td>', 'Awesome shot', '2009-01-19 17:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204881, 756082, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m bumping this up a point. The wheel turns an otherwise ordinary skyline-at-night scene into something playful and fun.</td>', 'I''m bumping this up a point. The wheel turns an otherwise ordinary skyline-at-night scene into something playful and fun.', '2009-01-19 17:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204883, 754605, 76335, '<td valign="top">Convincing. Effectively lit and composed.</td>', 'Convincing. Effectively lit and composed.', '2009-01-19 17:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204886, 755925, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit and good soft focus. Would like to have seen a bit more of her reflection.</td>', 'Beautifully lit and good soft focus. Would like to have seen a bit more of her reflection.', '2009-01-19 17:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204888, 756424, 76335, '<td valign="top">That''s a most interesting presentation! I wonder if it could have been lit to show more baby and less bag.</td>', 'That''s a most interesting presentation! I wonder if it could have been lit to show more baby and less bag.', '2009-01-19 17:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204891, 756748, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract presentation. A good study, but needs something more to add impact, I think.</td>', 'Nice abstract presentation. A good study, but needs something more to add impact, I think.', '2009-01-19 17:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204892, 754339, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great lines and textures; the angle is perfect. Would like to have seen it just a tad better exposed.</td>', 'Great lines and textures; the angle is perfect. Would like to have seen it just a tad better exposed.', '2009-01-19 17:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204895, 756101, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the simple and honest presentation of this. You leave the impact to the subject, and haven''t used trickery to turn it into something more.</td>', 'I like the simple and honest presentation of this. You leave the impact to the subject, and haven''t used trickery to turn it into something more.', '2009-01-19 17:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204899, 756672, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well composed and smart processing. The colors really pop.</td>', 'Well composed and smart processing. The colors really pop.', '2009-01-19 17:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204901, 754675, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great warm tones here. Effective use of backlighting. Seems to lean slightly to the right.</td>', 'Great warm tones here. Effective use of backlighting. Seems to lean slightly to the right.', '2009-01-19 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204910, 756767, 60495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, especially like the DOF and colors.</td>', 'Beautiful, especially like the DOF and colors.', '2009-01-19 17:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204911, 756520, 76811, '<td valign="top">Ich habe nicht!!! I love the image great light, sharpness and color!</td>', 'Ich habe nicht!!! I love the image great light, sharpness and color!', '2009-01-19 17:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204912, 754611, 76811, '<td valign="top">This should be  poster</td>', 'This should be  poster', '2009-01-19 17:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204991, 754971, 63633, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but it appears oversharpened.</td>', 'I like the composition, but it appears oversharpened.', '2009-01-19 18:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5204992, 755598, 63633, '<td valign="top">Wow - stunning eyes.</td>', 'Wow - stunning eyes.', '2009-01-19 18:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205008, 755970, 22459, '<td valign="top">love it !!! wish I was there.</td>', 'love it !!! wish I was there.', '2009-01-19 18:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205010, 756701, 22459, '<td valign="top">crisp, sharp and looks very nice.</td>', 'crisp, sharp and looks very nice.', '2009-01-19 18:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205013, 756274, 22459, '<td valign="top">"el penis" steals the show here</td>', '"el penis" steals the show here', '2009-01-19 18:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205014, 756520, 22459, '<td valign="top">wow, beautiful lighting and so so sharp, well done</td>', 'wow, beautiful lighting and so so sharp, well done', '2009-01-19 18:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205015, 755829, 22459, '<td valign="top">lovely image and a very special moment. love it.</td>', 'lovely image and a very special moment. love it.', '2009-01-19 18:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205017, 756755, 77192, '<td valign="top">Is she a bride? congrats to her if so. The surrounds are a little busy for me in this shot.</td>', 'Is she a bride? congrats to her if so. The surrounds are a little busy for me in this shot.', '2009-01-19 18:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205019, 756440, 77192, '<td valign="top">his expression is great. Your shot is very noisy though.</td>', 'his expression is great. Your shot is very noisy though.', '2009-01-19 18:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205022, 756287, 77192, '<td valign="top">I love her relaxed expression.</td>', 'I love her relaxed expression.', '2009-01-19 18:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205023, 756322, 77192, '<td valign="top">lol if anything I''d like to see mroe of this amazing sky and less of the mountain and wall.</td>', 'lol if anything I''d like to see mroe of this amazing sky and less of the mountain and wall.', '2009-01-19 18:40:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5205026, 756534, 77192, '<td valign="top">beautiful softness and colours.</td>', 'beautiful softness and colours.', '2009-01-19 18:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205029, 754579, 77192, '<td valign="top">The floating seems to break up the composition for me. Apart from that, it''s great.</td>', 'The floating seems to break up the composition for me. Apart from that, it''s great.', '2009-01-19 18:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205032, 756274, 63633, '<td valign="top">I think the model is beautiful and the image very clean, but the placement of the graffiti is really offensive.</td>', 'I think the model is beautiful and the image very clean, but the placement of the graffiti is really offensive.', '2009-01-19 18:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205034, 755785, 77192, '<td valign="top">This intrigues me. I like it lots. I quite like shots with patterns of light and light trails. The only thing I''m not sure I like is the bottom left with the fence and the people.</td>', 'This intrigues me. I like it lots. I quite like shots with patterns of light and light trails. The only thing I''m not sure I like is the bottom left with the fence and the people.', '2009-01-19 18:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205035, 756464, 63633, '<td valign="top">Great concept and execution. Let down a little I think by the composition.</td>', 'Great concept and execution. Let down a little I think by the composition.', '2009-01-19 18:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205038, 756485, 77192, '<td valign="top">A donkey? The crop is a bit close for me.</td>', 'A donkey? The crop is a bit close for me.', '2009-01-19 18:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205051, 754453, 81280, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! That''s quite amazing how they are nearly in a straight line</td>', 'Fantastic! That''s quite amazing how they are nearly in a straight line', '2009-01-19 18:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205068, 756098, 92085, '<td valign="top">//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=756098#</td>', '//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=756098#', '2009-01-19 19:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205128, 754672, 66602, '<td valign="top">outstanding! 9</td>', 'outstanding! 9', '2009-01-19 19:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205131, 755898, 102581, '<td valign="top">My favorite picture in the challange!</td>', 'My favorite picture in the challange!', '2009-01-19 19:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205132, 756034, 102581, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photo.  The clarity is very appealing.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is an amazing photo.  The clarity is very appealing.  Nice work.', '2009-01-19 19:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205141, 756339, 66602, '<td valign="top">striking! 8</td>', 'striking! 8', '2009-01-19 19:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205198, 755197, 102024, '<td valign="top">I kind of wish I could see this shot a bit wider.  Nonetheless, it is a wonderfully breathtaking scene.  The colors are beautiful.</td>', 'I kind of wish I could see this shot a bit wider.  Nonetheless, it is a wonderfully breathtaking scene.  The colors are beautiful.', '2009-01-19 20:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205205, 756763, 102024, '<td valign="top">Excellently composed!  The horizontal lines draw you through the image while the stairs guide your eyes across the composition.</td>', 'Excellently composed!  The horizontal lines draw you through the image while the stairs guide your eyes across the composition.', '2009-01-19 20:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205218, 756327, 30861, '<td valign="top">I have voted all the entries and done my first pass adjusting: at this point, this is one of two 10''s I have awarded, though I expect there will be a few more. I think this is a wonderful, thoughtful image. I am particularly taken by the way you allowed her shoulder to eclipse the corner of the frame, creating a connection between viewer and viewed. Well done!</td>', 'I have voted all the entries and done my first pass adjusting: at this point, this is one of two 10''s I have awarded, though I expect there will be a few more. I think this is a wonderful, thoughtful image. I am particularly taken by the way you allowed her shoulder to eclipse the corner of the frame, creating a connection between viewer and viewed. Well done!', '2009-01-19 20:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205222, 756336, 30861, '<td valign="top">I have voted all the entries and done my first pass adjusting: at this point, this is one of two 10''s I have awarded, though I expect there will be a few more. This is just an outstanding capture, in the pure sense of the word: WHAT a moment! My only quibble is that you didn''t dodge up the staring eye a little bit, I''d love to have it pop a tad and draw my attention. In any event, this is one of those images that makes you go "Holy Moley!" for the sheer con tent of it, and I''m rewarding it commensurately.</td>', 'I have voted all the entries and done my first pass adjusting: at this point, this is one of two 10''s I have awarded, though I expect there will be a few more. This is just an outstanding capture, in the pure sense of the word: WHAT a moment! My only quibble is that you didn''t dodge up the staring eye a little bit, I''d love to have it pop a tad and draw my attention. In any event, this is one of those images that makes you go "Holy Moley!" for the sheer con tent of it, and I''m rewarding it commensurately.', '2009-01-19 20:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205244, 754906, 76335, '<td valign="top">Terrific, Escher-like geometry here. The lines and angles are great! Bumping it up a point.</td>', 'Terrific, Escher-like geometry here. The lines and angles are great! Bumping it up a point.', '2009-01-19 20:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205245, 755367, 76335, '<td valign="top">Indeed. I like the shallow DOF. Good lighting too.</td>', 'Indeed. I like the shallow DOF. Good lighting too.', '2009-01-19 20:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205247, 755900, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, but the lines and angles work to maximum effect here. Would have been good in black and white I think also.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-23 23:52:48.</i></td>', 'A little grainy, but the lines and angles work to maximum effect here. Would have been good in black and white I think also.', '2009-01-19 20:38:08.000000', '2009-01-23 23:52:48.000000', 1),
(5205249, 754545, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely posed and composed, and great lighting. A little overshaprened perhaps -- not sure. The hair seems like it could (or should) be softer.</td>', 'Nicely posed and composed, and great lighting. A little overshaprened perhaps -- not sure. The hair seems like it could (or should) be softer.', '2009-01-19 20:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205253, 755065, 76335, '<td valign="top">Maybe needs something more to add interest. Good use of thirds.</td>', 'Maybe needs something more to add interest. Good use of thirds.', '2009-01-19 20:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205254, 755813, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia-ish processing of this. Good bokeh.</td>', 'I like the sepia-ish processing of this. Good bokeh.', '2009-01-19 20:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205257, 755000, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well composed. Wish the subjects were a bit closer in the frame. Looks good in black and white.</td>', 'Well composed. Wish the subjects were a bit closer in the frame. Looks good in black and white.', '2009-01-19 20:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205259, 756346, 76335, '<td valign="top">Just a little background blur or different placement of the woman would have better separated her from the background. She almost gets lost in those eye catching colors and shapes. Lovely processing.</td>', 'Just a little background blur or different placement of the woman would have better separated her from the background. She almost gets lost in those eye catching colors and shapes. Lovely processing.', '2009-01-19 20:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205262, 756355, 76335, '<td valign="top">You seem to have competing subjects. Nicely processed though.</td>', 'You seem to have competing subjects. Nicely processed though.', '2009-01-19 20:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205263, 754839, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well, every dog has his -- oh, never mind. Funny.</td>', 'Well, every dog has his -- oh, never mind. Funny.', '2009-01-19 20:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205265, 756689, 76335, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better in profile, so we can see both her and the doll''s faces. Still an endearing capture.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better in profile, so we can see both her and the doll''s faces. Still an endearing capture.', '2009-01-19 20:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205267, 756741, 76335, '<td valign="top">Processing is a bit harsh, but a convincing environmental portrait anyway.</td>', 'Processing is a bit harsh, but a convincing environmental portrait anyway.', '2009-01-19 20:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205268, 756044, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks good in black and white. Seems to lean to the right though.</td>', 'Looks good in black and white. Seems to lean to the right though.', '2009-01-19 20:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205270, 754365, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good panning shot. I like the reflection and the two guys (?) left in the dust.</td>', 'Good panning shot. I like the reflection and the two guys (?) left in the dust.', '2009-01-19 20:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205274, 756634, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but the focus seems off. Hand shake? Maybe better with a tripod...</td>', 'Great subject, but the focus seems off. Hand shake? Maybe better with a tripod...', '2009-01-19 20:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205276, 755605, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great colors and shadows, but something more is needed. Maybe a structure or building in silhouette also.</td>', 'Great colors and shadows, but something more is needed. Maybe a structure or building in silhouette also.', '2009-01-19 20:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205279, 754722, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting but your subject is too much in the shadows -- and what is it, anyway? Also, it strikes me as oversharpened, judging by the halos.</td>', 'Interesting but your subject is too much in the shadows -- and what is it, anyway? Also, it strikes me as oversharpened, judging by the halos.', '2009-01-19 20:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205282, 756636, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well composed, attractive colors. Bumping it up a point.</td>', 'Well composed, attractive colors. Bumping it up a point.', '2009-01-19 20:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205286, 755872, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good clean panning shot with great motion blur.</td>', 'Good clean panning shot with great motion blur.', '2009-01-19 20:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205288, 754791, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wow, the exposure is perfect here. Intriguing lights and colors abound.</td>', 'Wow, the exposure is perfect here. Intriguing lights and colors abound.', '2009-01-19 20:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205289, 755811, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great textures and cool blues here. Maybe a little less sky?</td>', 'Great textures and cool blues here. Maybe a little less sky?', '2009-01-19 20:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205298, 756474, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great how the woman echoes the bird''s posture. Follow the leader? A fun shot, and you made good use of a potential distraction (or maybe you meant to do that!)</td>', 'Great how the woman echoes the bird''s posture. Follow the leader? A fun shot, and you made good use of a potential distraction (or maybe you meant to do that!)', '2009-01-19 20:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205307, 754946, 76335, '<td valign="top">The lighting''s harsh, and the kid''s head and arm are clipped. Wish we could see his face. Not the most flattering look on the woman''s face either.</td>', 'The lighting''s harsh, and the kid''s head and arm are clipped. Wish we could see his face. Not the most flattering look on the woman''s face either.', '2009-01-19 20:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205308, 755237, 46336, '<td valign="top">This rocks! Gorgeous.</td>', 'This rocks! Gorgeous.', '2009-01-19 20:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205315, 756031, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Not much to critique here. It''s all about the eyes, of course.</td>', 'Excellent. Not much to critique here. It''s all about the eyes, of course.', '2009-01-19 21:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205320, 754347, 76335, '<td valign="top">Horizon isn''t level, but it doesn''t look like they care much. Excellent, really.</td>', 'Horizon isn''t level, but it doesn''t look like they care much. Excellent, really.', '2009-01-19 21:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205332, 756306, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. This would make a terrific pinhole image. I guess I''m seeing things now.</td>', 'Nicely done. This would make a terrific pinhole image. I guess I''m seeing things now.', '2009-01-19 21:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205338, 755697, 76335, '<td valign="top">Might be a bit too sharp. Nicely composed and captured though.</td>', 'Might be a bit too sharp. Nicely composed and captured though.', '2009-01-19 21:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205345, 755794, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent panning shot, a real sense of speed. Great exposure and good sharp focus.</td>', 'Excellent panning shot, a real sense of speed. Great exposure and good sharp focus.', '2009-01-19 21:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205346, 754854, 76335, '<td valign="top">Soft and dreamy. WOuld love to have seen this in black and white.</td>', 'Soft and dreamy. WOuld love to have seen this in black and white.', '2009-01-19 21:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205348, 755399, 15407, '<td valign="top">Excellence ~ Simple Irresistible... What did it have for POWER? looks to be the bigblock by the bulge starting in the upper reaches of the photo...<br/>mayhaps a ''435 HP''?</td>', 'Excellence ~ Simple Irresistible... What did it have for POWER? looks to be the bigblock by the bulge starting in the upper reaches of the photo...mayhaps a ''435 HP''?', '2009-01-19 21:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205358, 755583, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great sense of scale here. Lots to see. Good title too.</td>', 'Great sense of scale here. Lots to see. Good title too.', '2009-01-19 21:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205431, 755665, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice color spectrum, composition. THe sun glare is ok, not sure what the cloudy smudge is on top of the person.</td>', 'nice color spectrum, composition. THe sun glare is ok, not sure what the cloudy smudge is on top of the person.', '2009-01-19 21:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205433, 755133, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and composition, however it seems out of focus.</td>', 'nice lighting and composition, however it seems out of focus.', '2009-01-19 21:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205434, 756543, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Sky, water ripples (9)</td>', 'Great shot! Sky, water ripples (9)', '2009-01-19 21:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205442, 756292, 73564, '<td valign="top">WOW! (cant type any bigger) This is an AMAZING capture! I like the colors, and comp is great. Very Interesting.</td>', 'WOW! (cant type any bigger) This is an AMAZING capture! I like the colors, and comp is great. Very Interesting.', '2009-01-19 21:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205446, 754914, 31637, '<td valign="top">fish scoopers! love the cartoonish eyes.</td>', 'fish scoopers! love the cartoonish eyes.', '2009-01-19 21:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205447, 756343, 73564, '<td valign="top">wow, this is a very neat image, nice colors, and effect.</td>', 'wow, this is a very neat image, nice colors, and effect.', '2009-01-19 21:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5205450, 755005, 31637, '<td valign="top">Nice outfit!</td>', 'Nice outfit!', '2009-01-19 21:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
