(5206165, 754578, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Amazing detail and capture.  I am a big fan of strong saturation and color tweaking, but the colors on this seem unnatural.. yet not ''distorted'', if that makes <i>any</i> sense.  The textural ''depth'', or rather ''feel'', seems lost - hard to explain.. could be neat image, don''t know - having said that, could be intentional (including the coloring), if so, my apologies.  ''If only'' the fore legs and wing(s) in focus too and not ''chopped'', but that is really nit picking - I <i>know</i> how difficult these shots are (and have not taken anything even close to this) - including trying to process them.  Well done.</td>', '7 - Amazing detail and capture.  I am a big fan of strong saturation and color tweaking, but the colors on this seem unnatural.. yet not ''distorted'', if that makes any sense.  The textural ''depth'', or rather ''feel'', seems lost - hard to explain.. could be neat image, don''t know - having said that, could be intentional (including the coloring), if so, my apologies.  ''If only'' the fore legs and wing(s) in focus too and not ''chopped'', but that is really nit picking - I know how difficult these shots are (and have not taken anything even close to this) - including trying to process them.  Well done.', '2009-01-20 05:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
