(5210208, 755686, 86799, '<td valign="top">I see a white "W" flag flying over Wrigley.  Cubs Win!  Cubs Win!  HaHaHa, good shot.</td>', 'I see a white "W" flag flying over Wrigley.  Cubs Win!  Cubs Win!  HaHaHa, good shot.', '2009-01-21 17:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210293, 756602, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft light and expression. Love the close crop. I wish there was a hint more light on the eye. 10</td>', 'Beautiful soft light and expression. Love the close crop. I wish there was a hint more light on the eye. 10', '2009-01-21 18:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210296, 756114, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and composition. I love the close crop on the face. Looks slightly overprocessed or oversharpened but still wonderful. 10</td>', 'Wonderful color and composition. I love the close crop on the face. Looks slightly overprocessed or oversharpened but still wonderful. 10', '2009-01-21 18:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210299, 754384, 88204, '<td valign="top">Pose and lighting are truly amazing! I can''t wait to learn more about your setup. It appears you have side lighting from both sides and also back/rim lighting. My guess is you have two light sources on each side slightly behind. I also love how your subject is beautifully lit with minimal light on the floor and black background. Thanks for making and sharing this wonderful shot! 10</td>', 'Pose and lighting are truly amazing! I can''t wait to learn more about your setup. It appears you have side lighting from both sides and also back/rim lighting. My guess is you have two light sources on each side slightly behind. I also love how your subject is beautifully lit with minimal light on the floor and black background. Thanks for making and sharing this wonderful shot! 10', '2009-01-21 18:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210303, 754453, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! I can''t imaging how you were able to capture such a stunning shot! Amazing line, pattern, color, composition... wonderful! 10</td>', 'Wow! I can''t imaging how you were able to capture such a stunning shot! Amazing line, pattern, color, composition... wonderful! 10', '2009-01-21 18:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210309, 755866, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is pure, classic quality. Vingetting on the bottom is nice to pull us to the subjects. I think I would have vignetted a little more on top and on the left, although maybe you purposely left it lighter to let our eyes enter the shot. Great work! 10</td>', 'This is pure, classic quality. Vingetting on the bottom is nice to pull us to the subjects. I think I would have vignetted a little more on top and on the left, although maybe you purposely left it lighter to let our eyes enter the shot. Great work! 10', '2009-01-21 18:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210311, 754813, 88204, '<td valign="top">Amazing moment! Beautiful light. Great composition. I LOVE it! 10</td>', 'Amazing moment! Beautiful light. Great composition. I LOVE it! 10', '2009-01-21 18:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210317, 754498, 88204, '<td valign="top">What a classis vintage portrait! Great sharp focus on the eyes yet the netting is sharp too. Lighting is exquisite with beautiful sparkle in the eyes and a nice hair light upper left to emphasize form. Hand coloring effect adds to the vintage feel. Wonderful! 10</td>', 'What a classis vintage portrait! Great sharp focus on the eyes yet the netting is sharp too. Lighting is exquisite with beautiful sparkle in the eyes and a nice hair light upper left to emphasize form. Hand coloring effect adds to the vintage feel. Wonderful! 10', '2009-01-21 18:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210322, 756314, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression, great subject. The lighting really highlights the wild hair yet the face is perfectly exposed in softer light. Well done! I think I''d like more negative space in front of the subject but your composition creates additional tension. 10</td>', 'Great expression, great subject. The lighting really highlights the wild hair yet the face is perfectly exposed in softer light. Well done! I think I''d like more negative space in front of the subject but your composition creates additional tension. 10', '2009-01-21 18:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210325, 754797, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sparkle in the eyes. Great simplicity. Intense expression. B&amp;W works great. Excellent! 10</td>', 'Beautiful sparkle in the eyes. Great simplicity. Intense expression. B&W works great. Excellent! 10', '2009-01-21 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1);
