(5210405, 754504, 76335, '<td valign="top">What a fascinating scene, and nothing is lost in your smart processing of it. Great work!</td>', 'What a fascinating scene, and nothing is lost in your smart processing of it. Great work!', '2009-01-21 19:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210406, 755855, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great angle, strong sense of tension and perhaps anticipation.</td>', 'Great angle, strong sense of tension and perhaps anticipation.', '2009-01-21 19:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210408, 756712, 76335, '<td valign="top">I rarely score animal shots high (in fact, I''m giving all eagles in this challenge, good or bad, a five). Most animal shots look just like the last one I''ve seen. That said, I''m scoring this high, because it''s highly original. What you did here was no accident -- the shallow DOF, the square, dead-center framing -- all very creative and artistic. I like the illusion of his snout taking on a face of its own. Very well done.</td>', 'I rarely score animal shots high (in fact, I''m giving all eagles in this challenge, good or bad, a five). Most animal shots look just like the last one I''ve seen. That said, I''m scoring this high, because it''s highly original. What you did here was no accident -- the shallow DOF, the square, dead-center framing -- all very creative and artistic. I like the illusion of his snout taking on a face of its own. Very well done.', '2009-01-21 19:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210409, 755681, 76335, '<td valign="top">How grand! Stunning work.</td>', 'How grand! Stunning work.', '2009-01-21 19:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210412, 756682, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent lines, textures. The lighting is stunning. It all comes together to make a great image.</td>', 'Excellent lines, textures. The lighting is stunning. It all comes together to make a great image.', '2009-01-21 19:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210413, 754432, 76335, '<td valign="top">That made me jump! I''m looking for this in the top 10 or 20. Wow!</td>', 'That made me jump! I''m looking for this in the top 10 or 20. Wow!', '2009-01-21 19:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210415, 756711, 76335, '<td valign="top">Such a mature looking expression. This had to be tricky. Great work, nice high-key processing.</td>', 'Such a mature looking expression. This had to be tricky. Great work, nice high-key processing.', '2009-01-21 19:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210416, 754802, 76335, '<td valign="top">Cool landscape portrait. Love the background!</td>', 'Cool landscape portrait. Love the background!', '2009-01-21 19:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210422, 755829, 76335, '<td valign="top">The title nails it! Great street capture.</td>', 'The title nails it! Great street capture.', '2009-01-21 19:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5210425, 756325, 76335, '<td valign="top">Look at those yats... I can almost hear the music! (Doing a final pass. I love this. Great street photography. Bumping up two points.)</td>', 'Look at those yats... I can almost hear the music! (Doing a final pass. I love this. Great street photography. Bumping up two points.)', '2009-01-21 19:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
