(5210451, 756507, 76335, '<td valign="top">This one should float to the top. Excellent. Making it a fave, because I''d like to "try this at home" some time -- and, of course, because it''s most excellent. <br/> <br/>I''m making a final pass and calling this my pick of the challenge. I''m bumping it to a ten (the only one I''m handing out). Very artistic, great energy, and a real feeling of joy. Black and white was a touch of genius. Good luck!</td>', 'This one should float to the top. Excellent. Making it a fave, because I''d like to "try this at home" some time -- and, of course, because it''s most excellent.  I''m making a final pass and calling this my pick of the challenge. I''m bumping it to a ten (the only one I''m handing out). Very artistic, great energy, and a real feeling of joy. Black and white was a touch of genius. Good luck!', '2009-01-21 19:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
