(5211796, 755019, 86447, '<td valign="top">Too contrasty for my taste...You''ve lost some detail (like in the back pack) that should be there, I fear.   And I would have liked to have seen their feet or less of their legs.. cropped at the ankles (or any joint) is a no-no, I think.</td>', 'Too contrasty for my taste...You''ve lost some detail (like in the back pack) that should be there, I fear.   And I would have liked to have seen their feet or less of their legs.. cropped at the ankles (or any joint) is a no-no, I think.', '2009-01-22 13:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211801, 756104, 86447, '<td valign="top">Darn! From a slightly different angle this would have been much better, I think.   His far wings look odd to me.   It also seems a bit noisy to me... perhaps this is a crop?</td>', 'Darn! From a slightly different angle this would have been much better, I think.   His far wings look odd to me.   It also seems a bit noisy to me... perhaps this is a crop?', '2009-01-22 13:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
