(5211921, 755262, 60495, '<td valign="top">This shot to me is too busy and I find myself wondering were to focus my attention, I like the idea of the flower and the colors but feel it lacks one specific focal point. The knot in the wood on the left and the leaves on the right to me add nothing to the shot and I think it would have been better to crop them out and focus in closer on the flower against the red on the tree limbs. Hope the information helps, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This shot to me is too busy and I find myself wondering were to focus my attention, I like the idea of the flower and the colors but feel it lacks one specific focal point. The knot in the wood on the left and the leaves on the right to me add nothing to the shot and I think it would have been better to crop them out and focus in closer on the flower against the red on the tree limbs. Hope the information helps, good luck in the challenge.', '2009-01-22 14:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
