(5211943, 755698, 60495, '<td valign="top">My eyes were drawn to the focused section at the top which almost look like it should not be part of this image. The title suggest the focal point is inside but the inner sections lack a clearly focused area to draw the eyes into the shot. If the intent is purely abstract then cropping the top  focused section out would really help.</td>', 'My eyes were drawn to the focused section at the top which almost look like it should not be part of this image. The title suggest the focal point is inside but the inner sections lack a clearly focused area to draw the eyes into the shot. If the intent is purely abstract then cropping the top  focused section out would really help.', '2009-01-22 14:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
