(5212563, 754442, 34192, '<td valign="top">There''s a story here...I think the black and white works.  I go back and forth about the shadow on his face - typical photography ''rule'' would have it not there, but I think it adds to the story the photographer is trying to convey, title aside.  I think though, that this could use a little distance - moving a little further away would keep me from feeling so pressed against the scene, unable to tak it all in at once. 6</td>', 'There''s a story here...I think the black and white works.  I go back and forth about the shadow on his face - typical photography ''rule'' would have it not there, but I think it adds to the story the photographer is trying to convey, title aside.  I think though, that this could use a little distance - moving a little further away would keep me from feeling so pressed against the scene, unable to tak it all in at once. 6', '2009-01-22 19:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
