(5212593, 756426, 34192, '<td valign="top">Very classic, oft photographed, waterfall (even I have done it).  I like your exposure, and you did well keeping the detail in the rocks and plant life. I like that you added foreground interest but it still somehow feels devoid of life. Excellent technically, not so much emotionally. 6</td>', 'Very classic, oft photographed, waterfall (even I have done it).  I like your exposure, and you did well keeping the detail in the rocks and plant life. I like that you added foreground interest but it still somehow feels devoid of life. Excellent technically, not so much emotionally. 6', '2009-01-22 19:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
