(5212683, 756624, 34192, '<td valign="top">Cute scene.  Don''t like the color fo the frame (distracting) but I do think the vignette helps the image.  Great sharpness and good toning/colors. 6</td>', 'Cute scene.  Don''t like the color fo the frame (distracting) but I do think the vignette helps the image.  Great sharpness and good toning/colors. 6', '2009-01-22 20:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
