(5212715, 755662, 34192, '<td valign="top">So much going on. I think the lack of texture on the left doesn''t improve the image, nor does the shape of that empty space.  I am very interested in the variety of brickwork though - the most interesting part of the image.  The tones don''t sit well with me - they are not compatible, or at least they don''t tie the image together in any way.</td>', 'So much going on. I think the lack of texture on the left doesn''t improve the image, nor does the shape of that empty space.  I am very interested in the variety of brickwork though - the most interesting part of the image.  The tones don''t sit well with me - they are not compatible, or at least they don''t tie the image together in any way.', '2009-01-22 20:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212716, 756327, 52130, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot (the color and lighting) but the fact that her shoulder is touching the edge of that frame is really distracting and could have been avoided by you moving just a half inch to the left</td>', 'I like this one a lot (the color and lighting) but the fact that her shoulder is touching the edge of that frame is really distracting and could have been avoided by you moving just a half inch to the left', '2009-01-22 20:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
