(5212765, 755377, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Okay, I love rhinos. And you did an amazingly excellent job with the depth of field here.  your toning is perfect as is the sharpness.  you managed just enough of the tilt of his head to capture an eye but to still have it appear as a straight on shot.  I''ll admit it - in all my attempts, I have not gotten one this good of a rhino.  gotta give you that 10.</td>', 'Wow.  Okay, I love rhinos. And you did an amazingly excellent job with the depth of field here.  your toning is perfect as is the sharpness.  you managed just enough of the tilt of his head to capture an eye but to still have it appear as a straight on shot.  I''ll admit it - in all my attempts, I have not gotten one this good of a rhino.  gotta give you that 10.', '2009-01-22 20:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
