(5212906, 756763, 88729, '<td valign="top">love the structure and composition. title is awesome.</td>', 'love the structure and composition. title is awesome.', '2009-01-22 21:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212907, 756348, 88729, '<td valign="top">i really like this.</td>', 'i really like this.', '2009-01-22 21:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212909, 756658, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I recognize that whale!  Actually, I don''t, but I thought it sounded good.  anyway, having been hunting for whales, I know how extremely difficult it is to shoot them, particularly on a bobbing boat.  And this one is sharp, well focused, with a good composition and colors. 7</td>', 'Hey!  I recognize that whale!  Actually, I don''t, but I thought it sounded good.  anyway, having been hunting for whales, I know how extremely difficult it is to shoot them, particularly on a bobbing boat.  And this one is sharp, well focused, with a good composition and colors. 7', '2009-01-22 21:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212912, 756274, 34192, '<td valign="top">Okay.  Now, I''m hoping that you knew what was on the board behind you.  If not, oh well.  If so, I would have had my model try a different expression on her face.  The two just do not go together at all.  It is very well photographed - the toning, sharpness, dof and composition is perfect.  But, the incongruity, and not in a good way, really takes away from it. 7</td>', 'Okay.  Now, I''m hoping that you knew what was on the board behind you.  If not, oh well.  If so, I would have had my model try a different expression on her face.  The two just do not go together at all.  It is very well photographed - the toning, sharpness, dof and composition is perfect.  But, the incongruity, and not in a good way, really takes away from it. 7', '2009-01-22 21:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212915, 754523, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think your equipment failed you here.  You have excellent timing, a good composition, and great colors, but you seem to have been too far away to capture the scene without cropping it way too far.  It might be time to upgrade as it appears you have an eye for photography.</td>', 'I think your equipment failed you here.  You have excellent timing, a good composition, and great colors, but you seem to have been too far away to capture the scene without cropping it way too far.  It might be time to upgrade as it appears you have an eye for photography.', '2009-01-22 21:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212918, 754345, 34192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I''m surprised.  I really like this.  I think part of it is the reflections and the light bouncing off the car.  The scene behind the car is irrelevant to me as you did an amazing job with the car.  Not sure how, but i''d really love to know how you did it.  9</td>', 'Hmmm.  I''m surprised.  I really like this.  I think part of it is the reflections and the light bouncing off the car.  The scene behind the car is irrelevant to me as you did an amazing job with the car.  Not sure how, but i''d really love to know how you did it.  9', '2009-01-22 21:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212921, 756570, 34192, '<td valign="top">The bird and the stick just happened to land in the perfect place for this photograph?  No, I think you have an eye for finding the perfect place for the strongest composition.  Most people just pick out a couple of things to focus on when composing but you hit them all - the light, the bird, the stick, the water, the shadow...  nothing else but a 10 will do.  Wait, and a fave so I can remind myself of what a thinking photographer does.</td>', 'The bird and the stick just happened to land in the perfect place for this photograph?  No, I think you have an eye for finding the perfect place for the strongest composition.  Most people just pick out a couple of things to focus on when composing but you hit them all - the light, the bird, the stick, the water, the shadow...  nothing else but a 10 will do.  Wait, and a fave so I can remind myself of what a thinking photographer does.', '2009-01-22 21:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212923, 756256, 34192, '<td valign="top">Composed well and toned well with an excellent DOF for the subject. And such life! 8</td>', 'Composed well and toned well with an excellent DOF for the subject. And such life! 8', '2009-01-22 21:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
