(5212927, 754450, 34192, '<td valign="top">there is a lot of stuff here.  It all is given equal weight due to the extensive depth of field and even toning.  I wish there was a main point of focus to rest my eyes on.  It is sharp and I think the tones work well. 6</td>', 'there is a lot of stuff here.  It all is given equal weight due to the extensive depth of field and even toning.  I wish there was a main point of focus to rest my eyes on.  It is sharp and I think the tones work well. 6', '2009-01-22 21:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212929, 755964, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really like your choice of time for this and think the sunrise really enhances.  you''ve done an excellent job with the hues and the sharpness - both fit the subject.  The only think I would argue is that removing the top 1/3 of the sky would enhance and strengthen the composition. 7</td>', 'I really like your choice of time for this and think the sunrise really enhances.  you''ve done an excellent job with the hues and the sharpness - both fit the subject.  The only think I would argue is that removing the top 1/3 of the sky would enhance and strengthen the composition. 7', '2009-01-22 21:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
