(5213021, 754498, 60698, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B&amp;W portrait. It''s a perfect depiction of a 1940''s glamor, movie star type image! I can''t imagine anyone finding fault with it. She has that rare timeless beauty. Nothing trashy here! Pure class! It''s wonderful!</td>', 'Beautiful B&W portrait. It''s a perfect depiction of a 1940''s glamor, movie star type image! I can''t imagine anyone finding fault with it. She has that rare timeless beauty. Nothing trashy here! Pure class! It''s wonderful!', '2009-01-22 22:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5213023, 756641, 60698, '<td valign="top">Wow! what nice lighting, color and textures! The look on the horse''s face says it all.</td>', 'Wow! what nice lighting, color and textures! The look on the horse''s face says it all.', '2009-01-22 22:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5213024, 755319, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I think the sky is a little over the top, literally and figuratively.</td>', 'Wow.  I think the sky is a little over the top, literally and figuratively.', '2009-01-22 22:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
