(5213100, 756739, 83313, '<td valign="top">The pic looks a little soft. I woudl guess it was probably an extreme crop to get in this close. It''s a good catch of a real scene, however and the title is most appropriate.</td>', 'The pic looks a little soft. I woudl guess it was probably an extreme crop to get in this close. It''s a good catch of a real scene, however and the title is most appropriate.', '2009-01-22 22:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
