(5213116, 755531, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have to skip the vote on this one, as I know it''s a Melethia entry and that would influence my vote. I do like these street shots in Germany, however. The cobblestones have a great pattern, especially in this kind of light.<br/> <br/>Added: Ok, it wasn''t Germany, but I knew it was yours. Placed towards the high end, too. Congrats!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-23 00:29:37.</i></td>', 'I have to skip the vote on this one, as I know it''s a Melethia entry and that would influence my vote. I do like these street shots in Germany, however. The cobblestones have a great pattern, especially in this kind of light. Added: Ok, it wasn''t Germany, but I knew it was yours. Placed towards the high end, too. Congrats!', '2009-01-22 22:38:26.000000', '2009-01-23 00:29:37.000000', 1),
(5213117, 754386, 29011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. Gorgeous tones and I do like the crop. The blur/dof looks perfectly applied as well. This should do quite well. Good luck! ;) (no vote)</td>', 'Beautiful capture. Gorgeous tones and I do like the crop. The blur/dof looks perfectly applied as well. This should do quite well. Good luck! ;) (no vote)', '2009-01-22 22:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
