(5213469, 755531, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Was not something I was expecting from you.  What a fun photo.  Don''t you wish you could see what she captured?  Did she get flare? hehe  Did she have to reshoot because she missed the target?  I have to tell you, at first glance, I thought this woman was holding her camera up to take a pic of the couple behind her.  I thought she was being artsy clever.  But she is probably just taking a shot of a pigeon on a historic windowsill.  Oh well.  Thanks for making me wonder :)</td>', 'Ha!  Was not something I was expecting from you.  What a fun photo.  Don''t you wish you could see what she captured?  Did she get flare? hehe  Did she have to reshoot because she missed the target?  I have to tell you, at first glance, I thought this woman was holding her camera up to take a pic of the couple behind her.  I thought she was being artsy clever.  But she is probably just taking a shot of a pigeon on a historic windowsill.  Oh well.  Thanks for making me wonder :)', '2009-01-23 00:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
