(5213585, 755531, 97166, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> Ha!  Was not something I was expecting from you.  What a fun photo.  Don''t you wish you could see what she captured?  Did she get flare? hehe  Did she have to reshoot because she missed the target?  I have to tell you, at first glance, I thought this woman was holding her camera up to take a pic of the couple behind her.  I thought she was being artsy clever.  But she is probably just taking a shot of a pigeon on a historic windowsill.  Oh well.  Thanks for making me wonder :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>duuh! She was shooting an unidentified flying object that destroyed them ALL.</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: Ha!  Was not something I was expecting from you.  What a fun photo.  Don''t you wish you could see what she captured?  Did she get flare? hehe  Did she have to reshoot because she missed the target?  I have to tell you, at first glance, I thought this woman was holding her camera up to take a pic of the couple behind her.  I thought she was being artsy clever.  But she is probably just taking a shot of a pigeon on a historic windowsill.  Oh well.  Thanks for making me wonder :)   duuh! She was shooting an unidentified flying object that destroyed them ALL.', '2009-01-23 00:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
