(5213868, 756306, 3032, '<td valign="top">Didn''t vote on this one, but I would have given a 3 or a 4 (I am leaning towards the low scores in this challenge). The reason is that &lt;&lt;&lt;to me&gt;&gt;&gt; the subject matter is uninteresting, exposure and composition not great and the toning and mood a little bit depressing.<br/>Composition: It is not so great to divide an image exactly in half with the horizon. If the lantern is the subject, I want to see its foot. If the people are the subject, they are not very visible and put away in a corner. If the city is the subject, landscape would work better.<br/>Exposure: Sky to bright vs a too dark foreground. Fill flash, shadow/highlight to get details out of the shadows or layer multiple exposures to bring it out more.<br/>Overall it is simply not so interesting.<br/> <br/>But if you are happy with it, that''s great.</td>', 'Didn''t vote on this one, but I would have given a 3 or a 4 (I am leaning towards the low scores in this challenge). The reason is that <<<to me>>> the subject matter is uninteresting, exposure and composition not great and the toning and mood a little bit depressing.Composition: It is not so great to divide an image exactly in half with the horizon. If the lantern is the subject, I want to see its foot. If the people are the subject, they are not very visible and put away in a corner. If the city is the subject, landscape would work better.Exposure: Sky to bright vs a too dark foreground. Fill flash, shadow/highlight to get details out of the shadows or layer multiple exposures to bring it out more.Overall it is simply not so interesting. But if you are happy with it, that''s great.', '2009-01-23 03:55:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5213870, 756597, 28742, '<td valign="top">Them voters like to see the sharp, crisp veins in their eagle feathers, Steve. The blown/blurred head feathers hurt this in a very competitive challenge. Still a strong finish.</td>', 'Them voters like to see the sharp, crisp veins in their eagle feathers, Steve. The blown/blurred head feathers hurt this in a very competitive challenge. Still a strong finish.', '2009-01-23 03:55:53.000000', NULL, 0),
