(5213932, 756347, 30982, '<td valign="top">Exceptional.  One of my top picks for this challenge.  This has a sweetness, an innocence, a warmth to it.  And a sense of reflection and pause, for some reason.  Very pleased you entered this.</td>', 'Exceptional.  One of my top picks for this challenge.  This has a sweetness, an innocence, a warmth to it.  And a sense of reflection and pause, for some reason.  Very pleased you entered this.', '2009-01-23 05:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
