(5213940, 754672, 101730, '<td valign="top">It''s like the story of the lame leading the blind: blind frog on the bottom carries the lame frog who tells him where to go. Then again, it could also just be a really cool shot of two frogs sat on top of each other.</td>', 'It''s like the story of the lame leading the blind: blind frog on the bottom carries the lame frog who tells him where to go. Then again, it could also just be a really cool shot of two frogs sat on top of each other.', '2009-01-23 05:17:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5213941, 755000, 62357, '<td valign="top">Deb, best accolade of all, to have someone think it is one of yours!  <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Love Rina''s quote, and I think Joe thought this was me.  :-)  An excellent shot, my dear. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Deb, best accolade of all, to have someone think it is one of yours!   Originally posted by Melethia: Love Rina''s quote, and I think Joe thought this was me.  :-)  An excellent shot, my dear. ', '2009-01-23 05:18:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5213942, 754350, 41337, '<td valign="top">I can see why you entered it. This photo doesn''t keep the viewer at arms length like a number of those that placed higher. No, this one invites you in. There''s nothing phony or dishonest here. How can you not liked that?</td>', 'I can see why you entered it. This photo doesn''t keep the viewer at arms length like a number of those that placed higher. No, this one invites you in. There''s nothing phony or dishonest here. How can you not liked that?', '2009-01-23 05:32:26.000000', NULL, 0),
