(5213949, 755562, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Liked the tones and simplicity.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Liked the tones and simplicity.', '2009-01-23 05:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5213950, 756190, 55883, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your comments!!!<br/>I tried this in black and white, but it didnt look right to me, and i also tried a very tight crop, but again it lost something in my opinion. But I guess im biased!<br/> <br/>By the way, the two girls on the edges, that is their normal smiles, just pure happiness their from all three.<br/> <br/>Also, it must be my computer, but I cant see the yellow cast? I do not have photoshop or anything, so cant easily do alot about it. <br/> <br/>Thanks again for taking the time to look at my photo and for the feedback on it :-)</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your comments!!!I tried this in black and white, but it didnt look right to me, and i also tried a very tight crop, but again it lost something in my opinion. But I guess im biased! By the way, the two girls on the edges, that is their normal smiles, just pure happiness their from all three. Also, it must be my computer, but I cant see the yellow cast? I do not have photoshop or anything, so cant easily do alot about it.  Thanks again for taking the time to look at my photo and for the feedback on it :-)', '2009-01-23 05:40:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5213951, 754443, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Definitely amazing scene.  I remember pondering this image for a while - from the crop alternatives (without the sky), to wondering if the ''greenery'' naturally grows so prolifically there without the assistance of man and his ''weeds'' into the river system.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Definitely amazing scene.  I remember pondering this image for a while - from the crop alternatives (without the sky), to wondering if the ''greenery'' naturally grows so prolifically there without the assistance of man and his ''weeds'' into the river system.', '2009-01-23 05:41:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5213953, 756034, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Amazing sky and ray capture, coupled with an interesting ''seascape''.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Amazing sky and ray capture, coupled with an interesting ''seascape''.', '2009-01-23 05:42:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5213954, 755377, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Liked the feel/processing and eye connection/capture.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Liked the feel/processing and eye connection/capture.', '2009-01-23 05:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
