(5213962, 756216, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8, mainly because I think this size doesn''t do this justice.  Perhaps a whisker up on the right to straighten (reflection seems slightly off anyway) and some tweaking in post processing to bring the colors to life more, maybe a little selective sharpening of the fore - that and 720 might have given this an edge.</td>', 'I gave this an 8, mainly because I think this size doesn''t do this justice.  Perhaps a whisker up on the right to straighten (reflection seems slightly off anyway) and some tweaking in post processing to bring the colors to life more, maybe a little selective sharpening of the fore - that and 720 might have given this an edge.', '2009-01-23 05:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
