(5214195, 756730, 61961, '<td valign="top">Wow, Jeb, I had no idea this was yours.  It''s a stunner, marred however by the bullseye/circles others have mentioned.  Still got a ''9'' from me.</td>', 'Wow, Jeb, I had no idea this was yours.  It''s a stunner, marred however by the bullseye/circles others have mentioned.  Still got a ''9'' from me.', '2009-01-23 09:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214200, 755133, 61961, '<td valign="top">Powerful in its own way, and timeless.  I''m happy to have been one of your 9s.  Thanks for not pimping the eyes. :-)<br/></td>', 'Powerful in its own way, and timeless.  I''m happy to have been one of your 9s.  Thanks for not pimping the eyes. :-)', '2009-01-23 09:11:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214201, 756192, 61961, '<td valign="top">This got a high score from me.  I really love the painterly quality and admired the risk you took to enter an "abstract" for the challenge.  I think it might be a stronger image with some of the top lopped off, but what do I know?  Cheers and best to you,</td>', 'This got a high score from me.  I really love the painterly quality and admired the risk you took to enter an "abstract" for the challenge.  I think it might be a stronger image with some of the top lopped off, but what do I know?  Cheers and best to you,', '2009-01-23 09:15:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214202, 756686, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great action photojournalism.  Really exciting.  The background can be a problem in these locales but yours works.</td>', 'Great action photojournalism.  Really exciting.  The background can be a problem in these locales but yours works.', '2009-01-23 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214203, 755964, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2009-01-23 09:18:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214204, 756716, 61961, '<td valign="top">As someone else commented, that bright white corner is an eye-grabber, though I can see what you would lose by trying to crop it.  Love the blur around the train -- at first glance it makes the photo look like a miniature scene.  Overall very pleasing and it got a high score from me.</td>', 'As someone else commented, that bright white corner is an eye-grabber, though I can see what you would lose by trying to crop it.  Love the blur around the train -- at first glance it makes the photo look like a miniature scene.  Overall very pleasing and it got a high score from me.', '2009-01-23 09:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214206, 755245, 51538, '<td valign="top">Got an 8 from me and I came back to appreciate.  I took a long boat trip from Wuhan up the Changjiang to Chongqing in the early 80s.  Before modernization.  Have you ever read <a href="//www.amazon.com/Single-Pebble-John-Hersey/dp/0394756975" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">A Single Pebble</a> by John Hersey?</td>', 'Got an 8 from me and I came back to appreciate.  I took a long boat trip from Wuhan up the Changjiang to Chongqing in the early 80s.  Before modernization.  Have you ever read A Single Pebble by John Hersey?', '2009-01-23 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214207, 755927, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think you gave yourself a tough hill to climb by entering a butterfly &amp; flower photo in this annual challenge, but the image itself is just right.<br/> <br/>By the way, I remember you from fujimugs... you''ve come a long way!</td>', 'I think you gave yourself a tough hill to climb by entering a butterfly & flower photo in this annual challenge, but the image itself is just right. By the way, I remember you from fujimugs... you''ve come a long way!', '2009-01-23 09:23:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214209, 755681, 84363, '<td valign="top">Absolutley amazing!  Your colors are truly wonderful!</td>', 'Absolutley amazing!  Your colors are truly wonderful!', '2009-01-23 09:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214215, 756098, 61961, '<td valign="top">I love the light, it is a beautiful image, though marred I think by something (sharpening artifacts?) around the edges of the bird, which makes it seem a bit muddy.</td>', 'I love the light, it is a beautiful image, though marred I think by something (sharpening artifacts?) around the edges of the bird, which makes it seem a bit muddy.', '2009-01-23 09:29:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214219, 756328, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great comp, and I like how the surprise of the "join line" when one realizes it is not a real person.  Oh, definitely underrated.</td>', 'Great comp, and I like how the surprise of the "join line" when one realizes it is not a real person.  Oh, definitely underrated.', '2009-01-23 09:31:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214223, 755132, 61961, '<td valign="top">Something about this grabbed me while voting and it still does!  I''m happy to have been one of your 9s.</td>', 'Something about this grabbed me while voting and it still does!  I''m happy to have been one of your 9s.', '2009-01-23 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214234, 754350, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  Congrats!</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  Congrats!', '2009-01-23 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214245, 755935, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the detail in the eye and how the gannet stands out in a field of blue.  I can just see faint haloing around the wings so maybe a bit too much hightlight/shadow or sharpening.  Other than that a very nice image.<br/> <br/>I have to look up this place as I''m going back to Scotland in June.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-23 09:46:24.</i></td>', 'I like the detail in the eye and how the gannet stands out in a field of blue.  I can just see faint haloing around the wings so maybe a bit too much hightlight/shadow or sharpening.  Other than that a very nice image. I have to look up this place as I''m going back to Scotland in June.', '2009-01-23 09:42:50.000000', '2009-01-23 09:46:24.000000', 0),
(5214250, 756292, 58457, '<td valign="top">How this did not win is a mystery to me.  It litterally blew the competition away.</td>', 'How this did not win is a mystery to me.  It litterally blew the competition away.', '2009-01-23 09:44:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214260, 756314, 97893, '<td valign="top">This was/is my favorite-most shot of the best of 2008 series. And I simply love it! <br/> <br/>The expression that you have capture of her, the composition,  the background color blending into the color of the subject, and the overall feel -all are excellent here. There is small glich in blown out hair (but I shall live with it).<br/> <br/>It is  a picture that stays with you...<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Vikram</td>', 'This was/is my favorite-most shot of the best of 2008 series. And I simply love it!  The expression that you have capture of her, the composition,  the background color blending into the color of the subject, and the overall feel -all are excellent here. There is small glich in blown out hair (but I shall live with it). It is  a picture that stays with you... Thanks for sharing! Regards,Vikram', '2009-01-23 09:50:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214261, 756306, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the vintage look to the image however, a few things stand out for me that could use improvement:<br/> <br/>1)The horizon feels tilted (though may be the mist) even though the lamp post is straight.  Just gives it a feel of being unbalanced.<br/> <br/>2)The horizon is pretty much through the middle which makes the image very static.<br/> <br/>I''m wondering if a view along the railing (keeping the lamp post in the foreground) could of added some needed dynamics to the image.<br/> <br/>I didn''t score this one but probably would of scored it a 4 or 5.</td>', 'I like the vintage look to the image however, a few things stand out for me that could use improvement: 1)The horizon feels tilted (though may be the mist) even though the lamp post is straight.  Just gives it a feel of being unbalanced. 2)The horizon is pretty much through the middle which makes the image very static. I''m wondering if a view along the railing (keeping the lamp post in the foreground) could of added some needed dynamics to the image. I didn''t score this one but probably would of scored it a 4 or 5.', '2009-01-23 09:51:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214263, 756314, 97893, '<td valign="top">This was/is my favorite-most shot of the best of 2008 series. And I simply love it! <br/> <br/>The expression that you have capture of her, the composition,  the background color blending into the color of the subject, and the overall feel -all are excellent here. There is small glich in blown out hair (but I shall live with it).<br/> <br/>It is  a picture that stays with you...<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Vikram<br/> <br/>P.S. Also the subject is so beautiful. God Bless!</td>', 'This was/is my favorite-most shot of the best of 2008 series. And I simply love it!  The expression that you have capture of her, the composition,  the background color blending into the color of the subject, and the overall feel -all are excellent here. There is small glich in blown out hair (but I shall live with it). It is  a picture that stays with you... Thanks for sharing! Regards,Vikram P.S. Also the subject is so beautiful. God Bless!', '2009-01-23 09:51:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214265, 756499, 99063, '<td valign="top">Hey Sandi!  Looks like you''re just one below me in this challenge! :D  woot woot!</td>', 'Hey Sandi!  Looks like you''re just one below me in this challenge! :D  woot woot!', '2009-01-23 09:52:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214271, 756637, 15305, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot to you for sharing such a wonderful and powerful image, yet such peaceful!! I could stare at it for hours, I already marked it as a favorite.<br/>Congratulations on your score and placement and your new P.B<br/>_________________________________________________<br/> <br/>Yay!!!!! 10th place!!! Congratulations!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-23 13:53:58.</i></td>', 'Thanks a lot to you for sharing such a wonderful and powerful image, yet such peaceful!! I could stare at it for hours, I already marked it as a favorite.Congratulations on your score and placement and your new P.B_________________________________________________ Yay!!!!! 10th place!!! Congratulations!!', '2009-01-23 09:59:21.000000', '2009-01-23 13:53:58.000000', 0),
(5214274, 754881, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness.  This is one of the most beautiful, dramatic photos I''ve ever seen.  A fine choice for top honors in this prestigious challenge!  Congratulations!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmygoodness.  This is one of the most beautiful, dramatic photos I''ve ever seen.  A fine choice for top honors in this prestigious challenge!  Congratulations! ', '2009-01-23 10:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214275, 755681, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy Heavens!  I''ve never seen a church photo this flawlessly beautiful.  It belongs in a museum!  The only thing surprising is that you were surprised at how deserving it is to win in a challenge like this.   CONGRATULATIONS!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmy Heavens!  I''ve never seen a church photo this flawlessly beautiful.  It belongs in a museum!  The only thing surprising is that you were surprised at how deserving it is to win in a challenge like this.   CONGRATULATIONS! ', '2009-01-23 10:05:16.000000', NULL, 0),
