(5214277, 754655, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really love this Michelle.  It reminds me of a Norman Rockwell type of photo.  Childhood is so enhanced with your processing somehow.  It just looks great!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really love this Michelle.  It reminds me of a Norman Rockwell type of photo.  Childhood is so enhanced with your processing somehow.  It just looks great! ', '2009-01-23 10:06:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214278, 756292, 60495, '<td valign="top">Wow, thanks for all the post challenge comments, this was the image I knew this was the one shot I took last year that would have the most impact but it easily exceeded my expectations. Glad so many people enjoyed it! I especially liked all the Wows, Awesomes and Amazings in the comments. Thanks again!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-23 10:44:25.</i></td>', 'Wow, thanks for all the post challenge comments, this was the image I knew this was the one shot I took last year that would have the most impact but it easily exceeded my expectations. Glad so many people enjoyed it! I especially liked all the Wows, Awesomes and Amazings in the comments. Thanks again!', '2009-01-23 10:09:18.000000', '2009-01-23 10:44:25.000000', 0),
