(5214421, 754945, 6519, '<td valign="top">Since you asked in a forum thread...... I didn''t vote, but here are my guesses to explain the lower votes (I don''t necessarily agree with everyone, I''m just guessing people''s reasons):<br/> <br/>1) Butterfly shots are very common<br/>2) Some butterflies are much more colorful than this one<br/>3) The OOF issues<br/>4) Whilst the background is slightly blurred, the whole photo is still very busy and the subject doesn''t stand out from it all.<br/></td>', 'Since you asked in a forum thread...... I didn''t vote, but here are my guesses to explain the lower votes (I don''t necessarily agree with everyone, I''m just guessing people''s reasons): 1) Butterfly shots are very common2) Some butterflies are much more colorful than this one3) The OOF issues4) Whilst the background is slightly blurred, the whole photo is still very busy and the subject doesn''t stand out from it all.', '2009-01-23 11:43:59.000000', NULL, 0),
