they actually seeing the photograph and looking at it....or, were they bypassing it and looking only for flaws???   Seems to me it was the latter!  Such a shame to miss an entire wonderful photograph!   Ok...got that out...I can BREATHE now! ;)', '2009-01-23 12:35:31.000000', '2009-01-23 12:40:16.000000', 0),
