(5214764, 754962, 43088, '<td valign="top">In responce to some of the comments, it does look as though this might not be real.  These are live warhogs (ugly beasties) and were shot at the San Diego Zoo with a point and shoot camera which was converted to shoot in infrared only.   It was overcast so the shadows were very soft and this adds to the look of it being a set-up exhibit although it was not. Thank you for your votes and comments.</td>', 'In responce to some of the comments, it does look as though this might not be real.  These are live warhogs (ugly beasties) and were shot at the San Diego Zoo with a point and shoot camera which was converted to shoot in infrared only.   It was overcast so the shadows were very soft and this adds to the look of it being a set-up exhibit although it was not. Thank you for your votes and comments.', '2009-01-23 15:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
