(5214927, 754350, 30982, '<td valign="top">So many years ago.  The fence, which had been there for as long as he could remember, was gone.  Yet standing there, staring at the now barren land, he could still see the fence in his mind''s eye, and he could still see her.  How old was she that winter?  5?  6?  He couldn''t remember.  Too much time had passed since then.  But he definitely remembered her eyes.  Those gorgeous blue eyes that spoke of summer even on the coldest of days.  The way they''d stop a stranger in their tracks once she looked at them and smiled.  He longed to see them again - older, wiser, but still with that glint of sunshine, he''d bet - but it would take time to build up the courage.  He closed his eyes, pictured her once more as she was that winter.  Then turned and began the long walk back into his life.</td>', 'So many years ago.  The fence, which had been there for as long as he could remember, was gone.  Yet standing there, staring at the now barren land, he could still see the fence in his mind''s eye, and he could still see her.  How old was she that winter?  5?  6?  He couldn''t remember.  Too much time had passed since then.  But he definitely remembered her eyes.  Those gorgeous blue eyes that spoke of summer even on the coldest of days.  The way they''d stop a stranger in their tracks once she looked at them and smiled.  He longed to see them again - older, wiser, but still with that glint of sunshine, he''d bet - but it would take time to build up the courage.  He closed his eyes, pictured her once more as she was that winter.  Then turned and began the long walk back into his life.', '2009-01-23 16:57:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214931, 755681, 98771, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. Congratulations, it is truly stunning.<br/> <br/>Mac,</td>', 'This is beautiful. Congratulations, it is truly stunning. Mac,', '2009-01-23 17:00:02.000000', NULL, 0),
