(5214955, 754359, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  I was confident I was looking at the same scene without the child:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=727495" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/928/120/727495.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/928/120/727495.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/928/120/727495.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Very good dramatic image of the ocean.  Really like the movement and feel captured, especially bottom right.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  I was confident I was looking at the same scene without the child:   Very good dramatic image of the ocean.  Really like the movement and feel captured, especially bottom right.', '2009-01-23 17:13:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214960, 755561, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 - looked like it needed a whisker up on the left to straighten, but could be just a visual thing.  Beautiful capture of this amazing phenomenon, coupled with the lineal flow of the river and the reflection an added extra as well.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 - looked like it needed a whisker up on the left to straighten, but could be just a visual thing.  Beautiful capture of this amazing phenomenon, coupled with the lineal flow of the river and the reflection an added extra as well.', '2009-01-23 17:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
