(5214965, 756711, 83080, '<td valign="top">This is a favorite of mine from the challenge &amp; my wife, looking over my shoulder when I was voting, gave it a breathy, "Wow!"  Congratualtions on the photo &amp; I''m sure your nephew will be very grateful for this when he''s older.</td>', 'This is a favorite of mine from the challenge & my wife, looking over my shoulder when I was voting, gave it a breathy, "Wow!"  Congratualtions on the photo & I''m sure your nephew will be very grateful for this when he''s older.', '2009-01-23 17:18:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214972, 755257, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Amazing capture and I remember pondering this for a while and wishing that it had a whisker nudge up on the right or a perspective correction to straighten.  That and I ''experimented'' holding my hand up to remove the red bottom right (personal preference and all) - but, obviously, that was your call and either way, still an excellent capture.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Amazing capture and I remember pondering this for a while and wishing that it had a whisker nudge up on the right or a perspective correction to straighten.  That and I ''experimented'' holding my hand up to remove the red bottom right (personal preference and all) - but, obviously, that was your call and either way, still an excellent capture.', '2009-01-23 17:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214979, 754663, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  They''re such beautiful creatures.  Very nice capture of them.  Wondered about a slightly tighter crop at the bottom, but fairly minor.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  They''re such beautiful creatures.  Very nice capture of them.  Wondered about a slightly tighter crop at the bottom, but fairly minor.  Nice lighting.', '2009-01-23 17:25:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214991, 754386, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Really liked the composition and capture.  The ''hidden'' (visually) candid nature of this helps capture her seemingly ''far away mind''.  The clothing and accessories of course come up extremely well with your excellent processing - which if you could bottle and sell would perhaps make you a tidy sum.  The focal points too, very good.  Excellent image.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Really liked the composition and capture.  The ''hidden'' (visually) candid nature of this helps capture her seemingly ''far away mind''.  The clothing and accessories of course come up extremely well with your excellent processing - which if you could bottle and sell would perhaps make you a tidy sum.  The focal points too, very good.  Excellent image.', '2009-01-23 17:32:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214994, 754387, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Beautiful warm light and colors.  Just a more refined crop, but fairly minor.  I''m sure this size doesn''t do this justice.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Beautiful warm light and colors.  Just a more refined crop, but fairly minor.  I''m sure this size doesn''t do this justice.', '2009-01-23 17:33:17.000000', NULL, 0),
