(5215033, 756750, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 and remember looking at the bird and assuming you either got lucky and/or was patient enough for one to ''enter stage'', on reading your notes seems I was right.  Why someone would think you pasted it in is shallow.  Really nit-picking, main thing that held it back for me was the capture of the feel of the water - ''if only'' more detail and texture... but very difficult.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 and remember looking at the bird and assuming you either got lucky and/or was patient enough for one to ''enter stage'', on reading your notes seems I was right.  Why someone would think you pasted it in is shallow.  Really nit-picking, main thing that held it back for me was the capture of the feel of the water - ''if only'' more detail and texture... but very difficult.', '2009-01-23 17:47:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215037, 756615, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Loved the clarity and colors.  ''If only'' a little more texture/depth/feel, but difficult and minor.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Loved the clarity and colors.  ''If only'' a little more texture/depth/feel, but difficult and minor.', '2009-01-23 17:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
