(5215052, 756288, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  Amazing scene, really liked the colors and depth captured.  ''If only'' a little more depth of field to show the fore water and that distant mountain (maybe, although then it might compete with the iceberg/shelf too much, who knows) and maybe a perspective correction (but could be a visual thing, apologies if so).   Always a beautiful subject to view.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  Amazing scene, really liked the colors and depth captured.  ''If only'' a little more depth of field to show the fore water and that distant mountain (maybe, although then it might compete with the iceberg/shelf too much, who knows) and maybe a perspective correction (but could be a visual thing, apologies if so).   Always a beautiful subject to view.', '2009-01-23 17:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215054, 755237, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 and wondered whether it was taken in a natural environment, glad to see the credit I gave was due.  Nice capture of one of my favorite creatures.</td>', 'I gave this a 7 and wondered whether it was taken in a natural environment, glad to see the credit I gave was due.  Nice capture of one of my favorite creatures.', '2009-01-23 17:54:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215065, 756747, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  Thought it was a very nice portrait of Mukwa.  I even went to the extent during voting to try to translate Mukwa, closest I got was ''Bear''.  Nice character capture of him.  On reading your notes...  well, this image is a priceless gift now for your sister.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  Thought it was a very nice portrait of Mukwa.  I even went to the extent during voting to try to translate Mukwa, closest I got was ''Bear''.  Nice character capture of him.  On reading your notes...  well, this image is a priceless gift now for your sister.', '2009-01-23 17:57:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215084, 756641, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  Liked the unique capture with the falling rain in the background.  Especially liked the clarity and detail in the ''snout'' and the eye.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  Liked the unique capture with the falling rain in the background.  Especially liked the clarity and detail in the ''snout'' and the eye.', '2009-01-23 18:06:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215087, 754769, 45475, '<td valign="top">So good to see some nice numbers on your work! Congrats for whoopin'' our collective butts :D <br/> <br/>Talk to you again soon! xx R.</td>', 'So good to see some nice numbers on your work! Congrats for whoopin'' our collective butts :D  Talk to you again soon! xx R.', '2009-01-23 18:07:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215088, 755697, 16230, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a terrific capture! It''s also an excellent example of being in the right place at the right time. Without the tilted horizon and sharpening halos this would probably have a ribbon. If it were up to me I''d also give the rainbow a bit more room at the top of the image. Anyway, congratulations on a great shot!</td>', 'Wow, what a terrific capture! It''s also an excellent example of being in the right place at the right time. Without the tilted horizon and sharpening halos this would probably have a ribbon. If it were up to me I''d also give the rainbow a bit more room at the top of the image. Anyway, congratulations on a great shot!', '2009-01-23 18:07:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215092, 756637, 22537, '<td valign="top">Congrats there Kat. Wow, you sure kicked some butt on this one! Did you tell them you cloned out the body floating in the swamp?? Nice job!!</td>', 'Congrats there Kat. Wow, you sure kicked some butt on this one! Did you tell them you cloned out the body floating in the swamp?? Nice job!!', '2009-01-23 18:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215099, 754840, 39850, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by clive_patric_nolan:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for the comment macrothing. Very good point about the crop for the upper right. I hadn''t noticed it strangely! But it would certainly enhance the image. Cheers for the advice. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Welcome, glad you agree.  Good thing I came back to check on this image (they have to implement a ''reply'' system).</td>', 'Originally posted by clive_patric_nolan: Thanks for the comment macrothing. Very good point about the crop for the upper right. I hadn''t noticed it strangely! But it would certainly enhance the image. Cheers for the advice. :)   Welcome, glad you agree.  Good thing I came back to check on this image (they have to implement a ''reply'' system).', '2009-01-23 18:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215112, 754557, 92864, '<td valign="top">Yes, surprisingly low score, considering the image ;)</td>', 'Yes, surprisingly low score, considering the image ;)', '2009-01-23 18:24:51.000000', NULL, 0);
