(5215193, 755258, 16230, '<td valign="top">I think a bit more separation between the frog and the background may have made this score much higher. It''s a great shot. I think the colors and contrast make the frog blend into the background a bit too much. Congrats on a great shot!</td>', 'I think a bit more separation between the frog and the background may have made this score much higher. It''s a great shot. I think the colors and contrast make the frog blend into the background a bit too much. Congrats on a great shot!', '2009-01-23 19:05:15.000000', NULL, 0),
