(5215247, 756111, 83080, '<td valign="top">I love the way you composed this.  I was predicting that this wold be underrated, and sure enough, it was.  Congratulations still on a brilliant photo.  Btw, this was also one of my wife''s favorite shots (a non-DPCer).</td>', 'I love the way you composed this.  I was predicting that this wold be underrated, and sure enough, it was.  Congratulations still on a brilliant photo.  Btw, this was also one of my wife''s favorite shots (a non-DPCer).', '2009-01-23 19:38:52.000000', NULL, 0),
