(5215264, 754540, 83080, '<td valign="top">These are the best flames I''ve seen in 2008.  Not sure I understand the comments asking for more detail and sharpness in the flames.  The textures &amp; lines you''ve captured are simply marvelous.</td>', 'These are the best flames I''ve seen in 2008.  Not sure I understand the comments asking for more detail and sharpness in the flames.  The textures & lines you''ve captured are simply marvelous.', '2009-01-23 19:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
