(5215290, 756654, 83080, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  It''s a wonderful combination of mostly colorful abstract textures with a small window of context.  Also, I like the angle since it''s more true to the feeling of being in a wave.  I didn''t expect to see this ribbon, but I''d argue that it''s one of the most underrated of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a great capture.</td>', 'I love this photo.  It''s a wonderful combination of mostly colorful abstract textures with a small window of context.  Also, I like the angle since it''s more true to the feeling of being in a wave.  I didn''t expect to see this ribbon, but I''d argue that it''s one of the most underrated of the challenge. Congratulations on a great capture.', '2009-01-23 20:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215322, 756629, 51747, '<td valign="top">I''m glad that you entered this because you liked it. I did the same thing.</td>', 'I''m glad that you entered this because you liked it. I did the same thing.', '2009-01-23 20:27:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215324, 756719, 100831, '<td valign="top">love the title AND this is a great first entry!!!</td>', 'love the title AND this is a great first entry!!!', '2009-01-23 20:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215329, 754434, 100831, '<td valign="top">Very very nice color saturation. Wonderfully composed - overall, a beautiful shot.<br/>I''m curious if you know "The Swan" by the composer Camille Saint-Saens.</td>', 'Very very nice color saturation. Wonderfully composed - overall, a beautiful shot.I''m curious if you know "The Swan" by the composer Camille Saint-Saens.', '2009-01-23 20:34:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215338, 754881, 97225, '<td valign="top">This shot is absolutely awesome. Congratulations on the well deserved ribbon. I can''t believe you can get out in conditions like this and take photos.(Well I do, coz you''ve proved it!)</td>', 'This shot is absolutely awesome. Congratulations on the well deserved ribbon. I can''t believe you can get out in conditions like this and take photos.(Well I do, coz you''ve proved it!)', '2009-01-23 20:41:54.000000', NULL, 0),
