(5215550, 756343, 54645, '<td valign="top">Back to look again. Still love it. Definitely the best 4.4 scoring image I''ve seen to date! ;) Forget the score, and read the comments. <br/> <br/>I particularly like how the dreary tint really sets off the passion of these cats. I want to know more about the capture, but I don''t want to spoil the illusion, so I''ll just enjoy the photograph. I would like to know if they are fighting or playing, I can''t make up my mind.</td>', 'Back to look again. Still love it. Definitely the best 4.4 scoring image I''ve seen to date! ;) Forget the score, and read the comments.  I particularly like how the dreary tint really sets off the passion of these cats. I want to know more about the capture, but I don''t want to spoil the illusion, so I''ll just enjoy the photograph. I would like to know if they are fighting or playing, I can''t make up my mind.', '2009-01-23 22:39:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215562, 754605, 60495, '<td valign="top">Still a very well done image, sorry to hear about the DQ.</td>', 'Still a very well done image, sorry to hear about the DQ.', '2009-01-23 22:47:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5215580, 756031, 88204, '<td valign="top">This beautiful image brought me into your portfolio once again. It was wonderful to browse your collection of stunning images, both at DPC and in your galleries on your website. My primary interest is portraits. I aspire to get the kinds of amazing expressions and compositions that you do. Thanks for the inspiration!</td>', 'This beautiful image brought me into your portfolio once again. It was wonderful to browse your collection of stunning images, both at DPC and in your galleries on your website. My primary interest is portraits. I aspire to get the kinds of amazing expressions and compositions that you do. Thanks for the inspiration!', '2009-01-23 22:58:02.000000', NULL, 0),
