(5215691, 756654, 39850, '<td valign="top">Haha, I''m not a ''troll'' nor a ''rb'', maybe a ''kook'' (you''re probably one too to get out there like you do) and, I was at least honest with my comment, too.  I admire that you were out there in the water, I certainly would love to take an image inside a wave, alas not ''equipped'' (yet).  I like the natural colors and patterns in the water and the ''gap'' and land beyond - I just wished it was more refined, as the <i>viewer</i> - but it is your ''image'' - you do what you want.  You have some good shots in your portfolio too... Mr Backlash.</td>', 'Haha, I''m not a ''troll'' nor a ''rb'', maybe a ''kook'' (you''re probably one too to get out there like you do) and, I was at least honest with my comment, too.  I admire that you were out there in the water, I certainly would love to take an image inside a wave, alas not ''equipped'' (yet).  I like the natural colors and patterns in the water and the ''gap'' and land beyond - I just wished it was more refined, as the viewer - but it is your ''image'' - you do what you want.  You have some good shots in your portfolio too... Mr Backlash.', '2009-01-23 23:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
