(5216333, 755643, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image. The fog makes the entire scene more intriguing, and somehow more dramatic too. The high contrast black and white is perfect, and helps make the shot feel timeless. I love the bird stretching it''s neck upward is in silhouette but the other birds have some details in the light. It works so well.</td>', 'What a beautiful image. The fog makes the entire scene more intriguing, and somehow more dramatic too. The high contrast black and white is perfect, and helps make the shot feel timeless. I love the bird stretching it''s neck upward is in silhouette but the other birds have some details in the light. It works so well.', '2009-01-24 12:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
