(5216714, 756320, 56502, '<td valign="top">I won''t go so far to buy a spider, just looking from the top of the monitor was enough to see more details in the face. You are right, the details are there. Thanks for the hint. (I could increase the brightness, but then I loose the details in the highlights in other pictures - or buy a better monitor that is able to display everything from white to black ...)</td>', 'I won''t go so far to buy a spider, just looking from the top of the monitor was enough to see more details in the face. You are right, the details are there. Thanks for the hint. (I could increase the brightness, but then I loose the details in the highlights in other pictures - or buy a better monitor that is able to display everything from white to black ...)', '2009-01-24 16:25:52.000000', NULL, 0),
