(5218252, 754675, 100301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JDubsgirl:</b></div><hr/><i> HA! I am so freaking glad you entered this!!! top 100, no doubt. i love it i love it i love it!!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, I wasn''t top 100. but look at YOU!!</td>', 'Originally posted by JDubsgirl: HA! I am so freaking glad you entered this!!! top 100, no doubt. i love it i love it i love it!!!!   Well, I wasn''t top 100. but look at YOU!!', '2009-01-25 16:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5218254, 754390, 39427, '<td valign="top">As a stand alone shot without a theme to go off of, I don''t really get this shot.  She is at once pretty and dirty, has make up on, but then is messy.  So is she a street urchin or a regular girl?  I don''t really understand - its half glamor, half grit, but maybe therein lies the art!  From a technical standpoint this image stands out, and you are amassing a really nice portfolio of images</td>', 'As a stand alone shot without a theme to go off of, I don''t really get this shot.  She is at once pretty and dirty, has make up on, but then is messy.  So is she a street urchin or a regular girl?  I don''t really understand - its half glamor, half grit, but maybe therein lies the art!  From a technical standpoint this image stands out, and you are amassing a really nice portfolio of images', '2009-01-25 16:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
