(5218517, 755681, 59029, '<td valign="top">Wow, Leo!  What a way to start off the new year!  Huge congrats on the blue and a lovely image.</td>', 'Wow, Leo!  What a way to start off the new year!  Huge congrats on the blue and a lovely image.', '2009-01-25 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5218526, 756757, 25678, '<td valign="top">And may I reciprocate the compliment! The storytelling in your photos are superb, and if someone takes more than three seconds to look at them, gets drawn into them. Really enjoy this.<br/>cheers</td>', 'And may I reciprocate the compliment! The storytelling in your photos are superb, and if someone takes more than three seconds to look at them, gets drawn into them. Really enjoy this.cheers', '2009-01-25 19:55:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5218670, 756506, 714, '<td valign="top">thanks everyone..I know, everyone has their preferences about it being to center........  I like it.  I have one off center and it did nothing for me. Seems like everything has to be off center..well i feel like I have grown in photography enough to place things where ever in a photo as long as I have the right angle.  Subject of course does matter.  <br/> <br/>I put my foot down..no more rule of thirds.  it is to "in the box" for me. :-))</td>', 'thanks everyone..I know, everyone has their preferences about it being to center........  I like it.  I have one off center and it did nothing for me. Seems like everything has to be off center..well i feel like I have grown in photography enough to place things where ever in a photo as long as I have the right angle.  Subject of course does matter.   I put my foot down..no more rule of thirds.  it is to "in the box" for me. :-))', '2009-01-25 21:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5218763, 755964, 53964, '<td valign="top">Now I wanna go back there... but not until everything thaws and melts :)</td>', 'Now I wanna go back there... but not until everything thaws and melts :)', '2009-01-25 21:52:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5219126, 756637, 78971, '<td valign="top">This was an amazing shot. I told you it was good. Hope to see more. It is hard to believe this is actually color without conversion. I liked the other shot with the geese as well. Will be in touch. JP</td>', 'This was an amazing shot. I told you it was good. Hope to see more. It is hard to believe this is actually color without conversion. I liked the other shot with the geese as well. Will be in touch. JP', '2009-01-26 00:29:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5219231, 754442, 53814, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2009-01-26 01:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5219240, 754557, 66384, '<td valign="top">It''s a beauty, Robert. Something for me to strive for. And such a beautiful place for your father.</td>', 'It''s a beauty, Robert. Something for me to strive for. And such a beautiful place for your father.', '2009-01-26 01:14:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5219423, 756580, 88523, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments all!  Likewise bvy!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments all!  Likewise bvy!', '2009-01-26 03:52:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5219521, 754881, 28564, '<td valign="top">great shot... i like it very much, i like the composition but colors are very beautiful... congratulations for your ribbon.</td>', 'great shot... i like it very much, i like the composition but colors are very beautiful... congratulations for your ribbon.', '2009-01-26 06:00:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5219588, 756462, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you and Matt back!  This is a lovely portrait.  I''m not a portrait photographer, but to the untrained eye (namely mine) this is very well done.  I like the pose, the lighting works perfectly, they both look warm and natural, and the processing doesn''t look like "processing" - it fits the mood and the couple very well.  The eyes in particular look very natural, very real - you did a great job not overdoing them but bringing them out just enough.  I''m betting they''re very delighted with the results!</td>', 'Nice to see you and Matt back!  This is a lovely portrait.  I''m not a portrait photographer, but to the untrained eye (namely mine) this is very well done.  I like the pose, the lighting works perfectly, they both look warm and natural, and the processing doesn''t look like "processing" - it fits the mood and the couple very well.  The eyes in particular look very natural, very real - you did a great job not overdoing them but bringing them out just enough.  I''m betting they''re very delighted with the results!', '2009-01-26 07:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5219709, 754489, 60862, '<td valign="top">That''s one intense stare!  Owls can give really good shots like this, and you''re very good at capturing them.</td>', 'That''s one intense stare!  Owls can give really good shots like this, and you''re very good at capturing them.', '2009-01-26 09:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
