(5220257, 755227, 80096, '<td valign="top">Is there any history on the creation of this monastery? I wonder if anyone actually fell off the cliffs during construction, it''s so close to the edge. I suppose if you''re planning on becoming a practicing Buddist in Bhutan, you shouldn''t be afraid of heights.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your high score in an extremely competitive challenge! Very well done! <br/></td>', 'Is there any history on the creation of this monastery? I wonder if anyone actually fell off the cliffs during construction, it''s so close to the edge. I suppose if you''re planning on becoming a practicing Buddist in Bhutan, you shouldn''t be afraid of heights. Congratulations on your high score in an extremely competitive challenge! Very well done! ', '2009-01-26 13:04:29.000000', NULL, 0),
