(5220517, 754685, 61552, '<td valign="top">Not my "photographic best", but my most famous.  It made the TV ABC News here in Fresno, CA, and I was interviewed.  I thought it would be used in court, but the District Attorney either wasn''t aware of it, was never told of it, can''t or won''t prosecute.  She would have if a citizen was launching those explosives at the airlines!</td>', 'Not my "photographic best", but my most famous.  It made the TV ABC News here in Fresno, CA, and I was interviewed.  I thought it would be used in court, but the District Attorney either wasn''t aware of it, was never told of it, can''t or won''t prosecute.  She would have if a citizen was launching those explosives at the airlines!', '2009-01-26 15:09:16.000000', NULL, 0),
