(5223644, 754881, 33736, '<td valign="top">There may be more famous Lighthouses, but living in the state with the most lighthouses (along 3000 miles+ of coastline, and accessible) is a blessing, isn''t it?  <br/> <br/>The hard part isn''t the Wintery shooting conditions, it''s the driving conditions in Winter trying to get to the Lighthouses that limits us.  Lucky (and smart!) you living where you do.  Beautiful (and powerful) shot. Congratulations.</td>', 'There may be more famous Lighthouses, but living in the state with the most lighthouses (along 3000 miles+ of coastline, and accessible) is a blessing, isn''t it?   The hard part isn''t the Wintery shooting conditions, it''s the driving conditions in Winter trying to get to the Lighthouses that limits us.  Lucky (and smart!) you living where you do.  Beautiful (and powerful) shot. Congratulations.', '2009-01-28 05:55:28.000000', NULL, 0),
