(5238833, 756702, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hi Penny.  Great eye to see and capture this!  It''s so easy to walk on by and not see unique opportunities that are around us.<br/> <br/>You rec''d some good feedback overall in your comments.  I''d agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a> on the cropping.  This photo would present stronger with all sides equal outside the natural window frame, then put a defining border on it to finish it.  Whites could be a smidge lighter.  Auto levels adjustment could have helped with that.<br/> <br/>Anyway...again, nice catch!  :-)</td>', 'Hi Penny.  Great eye to see and capture this!  It''s so easy to walk on by and not see unique opportunities that are around us. You rec''d some good feedback overall in your comments.  I''d agree with  bvy on the cropping.  This photo would present stronger with all sides equal outside the natural window frame, then put a defining border on it to finish it.  Whites could be a smidge lighter.  Auto levels adjustment could have helped with that. Anyway...again, nice catch!  :-)', '2009-02-04 09:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
