(5244980, 756677, 30982, '<td valign="top">I liked the shot well enough to begin with but add the commentary and it takes on new significance.  I''m so sorry for your loss - it sounds as though you and he were good friends, and that''s worth a lot in this world.  You''ll carry him with you always, and from what I can tell, he raised a very fine man.</td>', 'I liked the shot well enough to begin with but add the commentary and it takes on new significance.  I''m so sorry for your loss - it sounds as though you and he were good friends, and that''s worth a lot in this world.  You''ll carry him with you always, and from what I can tell, he raised a very fine man.', '2009-02-08 08:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245004, 754712, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is magical!  The light, the color, the hair - all very very good, but what really makes it is her very wise and impish expression.  From your notes, she''s one very talented, very smart young lady and she makes an excellent photographic subject!</td>', 'This is magical!  The light, the color, the hair - all very very good, but what really makes it is her very wise and impish expression.  From your notes, she''s one very talented, very smart young lady and she makes an excellent photographic subject!', '2009-02-08 08:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
