(5280387, 756702, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very well seen, and perfectly presented - fully squared, with a strong mono-c0nversion.</td>', 'Very well seen, and perfectly presented - fully squared, with a strong mono-c0nversion.', '2009-03-01 05:32:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5282630, 754506, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen people get away with cloning out what I would consider a major element, so you may have gotten away with getting rid of the ball. I''m glad you didn''t enter it though. I think it would almost make the environment too sterile, and we all know that when kids are around nothing is sterile, heh. <br/> <br/>When I look at this photo it takes me back to when I was that age. I can remember holding on just like that. Dad''s calf was firm, yet somehow so comfy and comforting.</td>', 'I''ve seen people get away with cloning out what I would consider a major element, so you may have gotten away with getting rid of the ball. I''m glad you didn''t enter it though. I think it would almost make the environment too sterile, and we all know that when kids are around nothing is sterile, heh.  When I look at this photo it takes me back to when I was that age. I can remember holding on just like that. Dad''s calf was firm, yet somehow so comfy and comforting.', '2009-03-02 01:05:21.000000', NULL, 0),
