(5298473, 754523, 87808, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JulietNN:</b></div><hr/><i> oh, um, well, a little out of focus, a little grainy, but would have been a great shot otherwise </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>to add to this qoute. <br/> <br/>You have totally got a great shot here.  It is just very very soft, you need a faster shutter speed to help with this and then unsharp mask will help too. <br/> <br/>I still think this is a great shot, just needs more work on it.</td>', 'Originally posted by JulietNN: oh, um, well, a little out of focus, a little grainy, but would have been a great shot otherwise   to add to this qoute.  You have totally got a great shot here.  It is just very very soft, you need a faster shutter speed to help with this and then unsharp mask will help too.  I still think this is a great shot, just needs more work on it.', '2009-03-09 22:45:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5300013, 755897, 34659, '<td valign="top">The feathers and shapes created by the movement are just terrific.  You captured the intensity of the predator as well.  Great work - I just love birds and you certainly did the eagle justice here.</td>', 'The feathers and shapes created by the movement are just terrific.  You captured the intensity of the predator as well.  Great work - I just love birds and you certainly did the eagle justice here.', '2009-03-10 22:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
