(5489053, 754507, 96534, '<td valign="top">This is an incredibly beautiful and meaningful photo - and I''m really impressed that it was taken by a 17 year old. You are clearly a very sensitive and mature young woman, and I know you will do really well with photography. Really outstanding sensitivity and compassion, and technically and excellent shot. Well done!</td>', 'This is an incredibly beautiful and meaningful photo - and I''m really impressed that it was taken by a 17 year old. You are clearly a very sensitive and mature young woman, and I know you will do really well with photography. Really outstanding sensitivity and compassion, and technically and excellent shot. Well done!', '2009-05-16 04:52:19.000000', NULL, 0),
