(5503042, 755620, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like it. I like the soft colors and the crisp details. The ''halos'' don''t look like halos to me, because they don''t follow the edges of the building. They look like cloud formations.</td>', 'I like it. I like the soft colors and the crisp details. The ''halos'' don''t look like halos to me, because they don''t follow the edges of the building. They look like cloud formations.', '2009-05-27 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5503071, 755620, 90414, '<td valign="top">Isn''t Topaz great at bringing out this level of detail? It adds to the drama of the diagonal composition. Dark clouds do get quite noisy if overdone, though.</td>', 'Isn''t Topaz great at bringing out this level of detail? It adds to the drama of the diagonal composition. Dark clouds do get quite noisy if overdone, though.', '2009-05-27 23:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
