(5578440, 756543, 47906, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy all the different hues of green that this shot encompasses. It is really stunning that you have been able to bring so many out in processing. I love the boat in the foreground, the reflections of it in the rippled water really is a treat for the eye.<br/> <br/>I also like the perspective of which you shot from, and where you have placed the horizon in this shot. It really works out beautifully. I kind of wish that we were a bit closer to the windmill however, I initially didnt fully encompass it was a mill until I read your title and searched through the photo for it. I didnt get to this one in the challege, but I do wonder if that hurt you a bit from the speed voters. Again, Lovely and tranquil, serene shot. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I really enjoy all the different hues of green that this shot encompasses. It is really stunning that you have been able to bring so many out in processing. I love the boat in the foreground, the reflections of it in the rippled water really is a treat for the eye. I also like the perspective of which you shot from, and where you have placed the horizon in this shot. It really works out beautifully. I kind of wish that we were a bit closer to the windmill however, I initially didnt fully encompass it was a mill until I read your title and searched through the photo for it. I didnt get to this one in the challege, but I do wonder if that hurt you a bit from the speed voters. Again, Lovely and tranquil, serene shot. Thanks for sharing.', '2009-07-18 12:54:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5578480, 756337, 47906, '<td valign="top">Very Beautiful sunrise capture, I do not know why this didnt score higher in the challege. I really like the semi-silohuetted mountains in the distance that have just enough detail to them without being overly powerful. The different hues and tones that you have captured are lovely as well. Looks like a very serene scene that I wish I could have been on that boat for.</td>', 'Very Beautiful sunrise capture, I do not know why this didnt score higher in the challege. I really like the semi-silohuetted mountains in the distance that have just enough detail to them without being overly powerful. The different hues and tones that you have captured are lovely as well. Looks like a very serene scene that I wish I could have been on that boat for.', '2009-07-18 13:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
