(5788350, 756637, 90495, '<td valign="top">I have this one tree on a farmer''s lot that I''ve been spotting for years. The other day I was on my break and drove there to eat my lunch, and stare at the mountainous landscape, and that tree would have made a superb image because it was snowing lightly and it was also kind of foggy. Of course I didn''t have my camera but I intend on going back to capture a similar moment in time, whenever it snows AND is foggy again. :rolleyes: I have a feeling those conditions will not be happening for a while yet... fog and snow. hmmm<br/> <br/>This is the kind of shot I want for my living room. Very beautiful and sublime, tranquil, relaxing. Nature just has that effect on me. That''s why I drive to that spot and stare at mountains on my lunch break. :)</td>', 'I have this one tree on a farmer''s lot that I''ve been spotting for years. The other day I was on my break and drove there to eat my lunch, and stare at the mountainous landscape, and that tree would have made a superb image because it was snowing lightly and it was also kind of foggy. Of course I didn''t have my camera but I intend on going back to capture a similar moment in time, whenever it snows AND is foggy again. :rolleyes: I have a feeling those conditions will not be happening for a while yet... fog and snow. hmmm This is the kind of shot I want for my living room. Very beautiful and sublime, tranquil, relaxing. Nature just has that effect on me. That''s why I drive to that spot and stare at mountains on my lunch break. :)', '2009-12-31 10:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
