(6327732, 756292, 86218, '<td valign="top">Good night!!! Another comment that echos the underrated quality of this image. I''m not sure that I would want tornados in my country as I''m already obsessed with weather and to chase these would just be another obsession that would consume my life. <br/> <br/>You did very well here and this should feature as a sighting of a lifetime. Congrats on getting it and taking the shot. You say you had to work the image a bit but I believe it rarely happens given conditions that everything works out the way you want. This is by no means a still life shot and this happens I can imagine fairly quickly. Yes it was maybe 20 minutes but. For this scene it was seconds. The houses in cram is crucial to this shot and does more to lift the image than just for scale and perspective <br/> <br/>Once again.. Great terrific shot from me</td>', 'Good night!!! Another comment that echos the underrated quality of this image. I''m not sure that I would want tornados in my country as I''m already obsessed with weather and to chase these would just be another obsession that would consume my life.  You did very well here and this should feature as a sighting of a lifetime. Congrats on getting it and taking the shot. You say you had to work the image a bit but I believe it rarely happens given conditions that everything works out the way you want. This is by no means a still life shot and this happens I can imagine fairly quickly. Yes it was maybe 20 minutes but. For this scene it was seconds. The houses in cram is crucial to this shot and does more to lift the image than just for scale and perspective  Once again.. Great terrific shot from me', '2011-02-22 23:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
