(7022320, 755832, 28276, '<td valign="top">I can understand the low scores, because people don''t always want to look for the story in a photo.  And they (the masses) certainly want stark reality, not Monet.<br/> <br/>In this, I see someone leaping into life.  At first it seemed to be someone leaping into the afterlife, but the more I look, the more it seems he''s coming toward the viewer, with that divine light bolstering and lighting the way ahead.</td>', 'I can understand the low scores, because people don''t always want to look for the story in a photo.  And they (the masses) certainly want stark reality, not Monet. In this, I see someone leaping into life.  At first it seemed to be someone leaping into the afterlife, but the more I look, the more it seems he''s coming toward the viewer, with that divine light bolstering and lighting the way ahead.', '2013-04-17 15:30:38.000000', NULL, 0),
